p/git/commits/00e520eb72c31da2cc5d3dc3401800cddf6c55e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/00e520eb72c31da2cc5d3dc3401800cddf6c55e2","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDAwZTUyMGViNzJjMzFkYTJjYzVkM2RjMzQwMTgwMGNkZGY2YzU1ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd","sha":"08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd"}],"sha":"00e520eb72c31da2cc5d3dc3401800cddf6c55e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/00e520eb72c31da2cc5d3dc3401800cddf6c55e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:19:41Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:19:41Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix bulk-registration rows throwing \"File is already updated.\" on completion\n\nregisterJobBatchFile never sent user_id, so uw-be defaulted the\nclaiming file_task_users session to user 1 (TaskProcessController.php\n:903, `$request->user_id ?? 1`). Completion then asserted the real\noperator''s userId instead, which never matched that session''s actual\nuser_id -- the completion UPDATE''s `user_id = ?` guard matched zero\nrows, and uw-be''s own message for that case is the misleading \"File is\nalready updated.\" Confirmed live. Threaded the real operator''s userId\nthrough the registration call too, so the whole row (registration and\ncompletion) is consistently attributed to them instead of silently\ndefaulting to \"system\" for one half and the real user for the other.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3dc0eef4d1f4824038badde269c74ef59351b496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/3dc0eef4d1f4824038badde269c74ef59351b496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDA4YmQyODgwZDQ5Njc1NDQ0ZTcyOTM1NTU4MGUyNmY3NDE5OTdlY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91","sha":"ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91"}],"sha":"08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/08bd2880d49675444e729355580e26f741997ecd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:44:50Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:44:50Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Normalize uw-be error/message into a readable string, not {}\n\nparseStyleA took body.error over body.message unconditionally via ??,\nwhich only skips null/undefined -- a real response was observed where\nerror was a non-string (an empty object) while message held the\nactual readable text, producing an unreadable \"{}\" in the UI instead\nof it. pickErrorText now prefers whichever of error/message is\nalready a usable non-empty string, falling back to JSON.stringify\nonly when neither is, so a genuinely informative object (e.g.\nvalidator errors) still surfaces instead of being silently discarded\neither way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c572a945fb8ba3d9b50b63e6f52a987cd72212ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/c572a945fb8ba3d9b50b63e6f52a987cd72212ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGFiM2ExNTVjNTZiODI4YjJhYmY3Y2QxM2ZjMWMzNDhjNDYyYjVlOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6","sha":"54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6"}],"sha":"ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/ab3a155c56b828b2abf7cd13fc1c348c462b5e91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:15:45Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:15:45Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add per-row next-task routing to Bulk Registration\n\nSome tasks have multiple downstream tasks with user_decides_next_task\nenabled, requiring an explicit next_task on completion or uw-be 400s\nwith \"Invalid next task.\" (confirmed live on a real task). uw-be does\nsupport metadata-expression-based automatic routing as an alternative,\nbut that path only evaluates when user_decides_next_task is off, and\nthe UI control for that flag is currently commented out in uw-fe''s\ntask-flow-tabs.tsx -- so an explicit override is the only way to drive\nthese tasks correctly today.\n\nAdds an optional routing column + a value->task_uid mapping (fetched\ndistinct values via a new GET .../column-values endpoint, entered per\nvalue on the screen, not free text against the whole sheet). Validated\nupfront across every not-yet-completed row before any registration is\nattempted -- a run against hundreds of rows shouldn''t discover a\nmissing mapping value only after burning through most of them. Mapping\nis also re-checked on every /start call (including a resume), so a\nmissing value can be filled in and retried without losing already-\ncompleted rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed1d45e88af5bfcd92b4470728e30ffeabae63a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/ed1d45e88af5bfcd92b4470728e30ffeabae63a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDU0NjQ0YTY4MWM5N2U0MjJjY2M0MzkwNWQ1Mzc1N2I1OTU5NTMzYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc","sha":"849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc"}],"sha":"54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/54644a681c97e422ccc43905d53757b5959533c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:43:52Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:43:52Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Surface the presigned-upload failure body, not just its HTTP status\n\nputRawBytes discarded S3/MinIO''s response body on a failed PUT,\nleaving only a bare status code to diagnose from. The previous\nx-amz-acl fix alone didn''t resolve a real upload 400 on RND, and\nguessing further blind isn''t productive -- include the actual XML\nerror body (SignatureDoesNotMatch vs AccessDenied vs something else\nentirely) in the thrown error so the next failure is diagnosable\nstraight from the row''s own error field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2578116ca391e5ab489f2d5cd074e6729685fade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/2578116ca391e5ab489f2d5cd074e6729685fade"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDg0OTM5NTgxNmRlMWFjNzg1NGU3Y2IwZTcwMTA0ZTI5ODFkZGFjZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8","sha":"559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8"}],"sha":"849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/849395816de1ac7854e7cb0e70104e2981ddacdc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:33:17Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:33:17Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Echo presigned URL''s x-amz-acl back as a header on upload\n\nputRawBytes never sent an x-amz-acl header, so any presigned PUT URL\nwhose signer included it in X-Amz-SignedHeaders (confirmed on a real\nRND MinIO instance) 400''d on upload — SigV4 requires every header\nlisted in SignedHeaders to be present with the exact signed value.\nFixed by reading x-amz-acl off the presigned URL''s own query string\nand echoing it back as a request header. No-op against presigned URLs\nthat don''t sign ACL at all (e.g. the local MinIO dev setup), so this\nis shared by every caller (acquisition, batch-split, transformation,\nbulk-registration) without needing per-caller changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a33371fc3f4cb729f336cc29309c113f648b7469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/a33371fc3f4cb729f336cc29309c113f648b7469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDU1OWNlZmI0MWM0NmY4NWJjNWRhZjc5MGM0MDBjMzliZTk1YjUyYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2","sha":"e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2"}],"sha":"559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/559cefb41c46f85bc5daf790c400c39be95b52c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:57:48Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:57:48Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix resolveModeFromPath silently failing under the deployed base path\n\nTook the FIRST non-empty path segment, which is correct for local dev\n(bare origin, e.g. /bulk-registration) but wrong the moment the app is\ndeployed under a base path: /ext/app/wa/bulk-registration''s first\nsegment is \"ext\", which matches nothing, so this has always silently\nreturned undefined on every real deployment for every mode.\n\nNever caught before because App.tsx''s `?? state.taskContext.taskCode`\nfallback happened to paper over it whenever a mode''s real uw-be task\n`code` column already matched the mode key. BULK_REGISTRATION was the\nfirst mode where that fallback also failed (previous commit), which is\nwhat actually exposed this. Now takes the LAST non-empty segment,\nwhich is correct in both the local and the deployed shape. Verified\nagainst both bulk-registration and acquisition under a simulated\n/ext/app/wa/ prefix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1784fe645a3ab1ecfbaf8212fbc114e445c6556e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/1784fe645a3ab1ecfbaf8212fbc114e445c6556e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGU4YTNhNThjNTNjN2ViNjI2NmRjYTY5M2NjNDQyNzIyZTk4ZjFiZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0","sha":"3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0"}],"sha":"e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/e8a3a58c53c7eb6266dca693cc442722e98f1bd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:41:52Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:41:52Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Resolve taskCode from the URL path, not uw-be''s task.code column\n\nThe BULK_REGISTRATION fix in the previous commit still depended on\nuw-be''s task_context/resolve handler independently resolving the same\ntaskCode via a get-all-tasks lookup keyed on the real task''s `code`\ncolumn matching this app''s mode keys exactly — not guaranteed, and\nconfirmed mismatched on a real Orion-wired task. taskCode has no other\nrole in this app (every uw-be call uses taskUid, not taskCode), so\nresolveFromUrl now falls back to the same URL-path-derived mode\nmode-path.ts already uses to pick which screen renders, instead of a\nsecond, independently fallible resolution. Verified: task-context\nresolves correctly even with both task_code and workflow_code absent\nfrom the URL, which previously 400''d outright.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e72d12e1554b6738c03c1cca0e471121674fde2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/e72d12e1554b6738c03c1cca0e471121674fde2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDNlZWVkNzZjN2FmMjVjZmE1N2MyMmRhZjEzZjMzNGNhYTk2ZDI2ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8","sha":"5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8"}],"sha":"3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/3eeed76c7af25cfa57c22daf13f334caa96d26e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:25:12Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:25:12Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix BULK_REGISTRATION still hitting the active-file check on real Orion\n\nReal launch context sent a stale file_id even for this no-current-file\nmode, so the earlier fileId-absence-gated exemption never applied and\ntask-context/resolve still called get-task-ongoing-file, 400ing with\n\"Invalid request of file status already completed.\" (found via live\ntesting against rnd-orion.innodata.com). BULK_REGISTRATION now skips\nthe active-file check unconditionally, since it''s never relevant for\na mode that only ever creates new files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84553b7a20f5e94be64b40ce1e6a77e58cbef353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/84553b7a20f5e94be64b40ce1e6a77e58cbef353"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDVlMzBmMWFjMTBlYzcyZDBlOWRlYTc2NzkxZjE4NDM0OGIwODZjZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557","sha":"af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557"}],"sha":"5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/5e30f1ac10ec72d0e9dea76791f184348b086cf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:06:11Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:06:11Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add Bulk Registration: spreadsheet-driven content acquisition\n\nTakes a CSV/Excel sheet (one row per file), lets the user pick which\ncolumn supplies the file name and which become metadata, then reuses\nAcquisition''s register -> text-extractability gate -> upload -> complete\nflow once per row against a generated placeholder PDF. Continues past a\nsingle row''s failure (unlike batch-split) since rows are independent,\nand is resumable via the same sheetId. Optional `limit` caps how many\nrows get registered, as a guard against a much larger sheet than\nintended.\n\nAlong the way, fixed two latent bugs that predate this feature:\ntext-extractable.ts''s gate used pdf-parse''s wrapper directly, which is\nunreliable against pdf-lib-produced PDFs (now reuses split.ts''s robust\ndirect-pdf.js path, hardening the real Acquisition gate too); and\ntask-context.ts''s \"no file yet\" exemption only covered ACQUISITION, not\nany other file-less entry mode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38dd3d74958179622153166067b08a5921c2d501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/38dd3d74958179622153166067b08a5921c2d501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGFmMDg5NjEwYjY4NmU0NGViNmYxZmE1NGZkZDBlM2RkNDRkYWQ1NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409","sha":"c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409"}],"sha":"af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/af089610b686e44eb6f1fa54fdd0e3dd44dad557"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:07:24Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:07:24Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add EXTRA_HOST_ENTRY hairpin bypass for backend->uw-be CloudFront/WAF calls\n\nrnd-be-orion.innodata.com (UWBE_BASE_URL) sits behind the same CloudFront/WAF\nthat already blocks large request bodies elsewhere. Since transapp-backend and\nuw-be run on the same box, reuse uw-fe/uw-be''s own extra_hosts hairpin pattern\nso these calls can be routed straight to the box instead, bypassing the WAF as\na temporary workaround. No-op until EXTRA_HOST_ENTRY is set in deploy.env or\nthe GH dev environment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4383fb0a59f8a73dc46337972fd7b2ab7f7d7426","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/4383fb0a59f8a73dc46337972fd7b2ab7f7d7426"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGM2M2M0YTc1YWFjZTM0MzU4NGRhZjJlYjBjNzNkMjNiZmFmYjc0MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5","sha":"e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5"}],"sha":"c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/c63c4a75aace343584daf2eb0c73d23bfafb7409"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:01:16Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:01:16Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Make batch-split resumable and retry-safe against uw-be''s RND-only flakiness\n\nA 263-chapter by-chapter split takes long enough that both a gateway\ntimeout and a real intra-request consistency gap on uw-be''s RND stack\n(confirmed absent against local uw-be+MySQL — not a read replica, not\napp-level caching) became routine, and every failure mode compounded:\n\n- callUwbe''s fetch() could throw (connection reset/timeout) and bypass\n  every caller''s retry logic entirely, surfacing as a bare 502 via\n  Express 5''s default error handler instead of a retryable result.\n- The parent file was marked complete FIRST, before any child existed.\n  Any later failure left a parent uw-be would never resolve as active/\n  claimable again — the root cause of every \"permanently stuck\" file\n  hit while building this fix. It''s now completed LAST, only once every\n  child is registered/uploaded/released.\n- A gateway timeout doesn''t mean the backend stopped — it kept running\n  server-side, so a second /split call for the same file (a reasonable\n  reaction to a 504) could race the first over the same not-yet-\n  registered chunk and create duplicate child files in uw-be. A busy\n  flag now rejects an overlapping call instead of racing it.\n- A chunk that registered but then failed later (no upload URL, a\n  failed upload) reused the same filename on retry, which uw-be\n  rejects as already existing — retries now generate a fresh name.\n- Retryable failures return 409, not 502 — CloudFront/WAF here replaces\n  5xx response bodies with a generic page regardless of what the origin\n  actually sent, which was silently hiding every real error message.\n\nAlso adds GET /split-status/:fileId, polling the same in-process progress\nstate a resumed POST /split call already resumes from, for the frontend\nto show real progress instead of a blind spinner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0095275d10034c54908e2d91b4b4fb0de618e9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/f0095275d10034c54908e2d91b4b4fb0de618e9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGU0ODM5Mzk2YzU1ZmQyYmVlODJlM2FlOTIxM2U0OGRkY2FiYWIyZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e","sha":"d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e"}],"sha":"e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/e4839396c55fd2bee82e3ae9213e48ddcabab2d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:00:53Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:00:53Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Guard missing upload URLs and unhandled upload failures in acquisition/transformation\n\nregister-job-batch-file/register-file can legitimately return no upload\nURL when the target task''s upload_to_storage flag is off, and putRawBytes\nthrows on a failed PUT — both were previously unguarded, so either one\ncrashed the request with a generic, unhelpful 502 instead of a message\nthat actually says what went wrong.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"915eecce99cf6bd6f7d2273af90adf1dd5d646e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/915eecce99cf6bd6f7d2273af90adf1dd5d646e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGQ1NjU4OGZkN2RlOWY4MmM4YWEzYTU5MGYzMzMwZTliMjNmNzgzN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882","sha":"54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882"}],"sha":"d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/d56588fd7de9f82c8aa3a590f3330e9b23f7837e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:58:57Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:58:57Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"rebuild frontend with FRONTEND_BASE_PATH set","tree":{"sha":"ea567f3874073ff41bd8f842b51bb6e35cc0b188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/ea567f3874073ff41bd8f842b51bb6e35cc0b188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDU0YmZjMmYyMTNjNjc4Y2ZlZGZjMjI5Y2EzOTkxYWJiYTkyNWI4ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267","sha":"6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267"}],"sha":"54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/54bfc2f213c678cfedfc229ca3991abba925b882"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:36:55Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:36:55Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Poll live batch-split progress in the UI instead of a blind spinner\n\nA 263-chapter by-chapter split can take minutes and often outlasts the\ngateway timeout, so the Split button used to just spin with no feedback\nfor however long that took. Now it polls the backend''s own in-process\nprogress (the same state a resumed /split call already resumes from) and\nshows the real current step and chapter count while waiting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea567f3874073ff41bd8f842b51bb6e35cc0b188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/ea567f3874073ff41bd8f842b51bb6e35cc0b188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDZlMzdjZjZlZDlmM2VjMjZiOTJmM2ZjMjRlZWRhY2NiOGYyYTMyNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749","sha":"63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749"}],"sha":"6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/6e37cf6ed9f3ec26b92f3fc24eedaccb8f2a3267"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:02:20Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:02:20Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Cache-bust the frontend bundle to defeat CDN edge caching\n\nConfirmed real incident: the browser served the pre-fix callBackend()\nbundle for multiple rebuild/redeploy cycles even after the origin\ncontainer had the fix (verified by diffing the actual bundle content\nserved to the browser against what''s on the container''s own disk — they\ndiffered). No nginx-level caching exists in this stack; rnd-orion.innodata.com\nsits behind a CDN this deploy has no access to invalidate, and every\ndeploy previously reused the exact same bundle URL\n(.../innodata-transapp.js), letting a stale cached copy persist\nindefinitely regardless of how many times origin was rebuilt.\n\nFix: the JS bundle filename now embeds BUNDLE_VERSION (the commit sha),\nmaking every distinct build a genuinely new URL — always a cache miss\nno matter the CDN''s TTL policy, no invalidation access needed.\nindex.html itself still has a fixed URL (it''s the entry point), so it\nadditionally gets explicit Cache-Control: no-store as a best-effort\nsecond layer — whether the CDN actually honors that depends on its own\npolicy, which isn''t visible from here.\n\nci.yml now passes BUNDLE_VERSION=sha-<commit> automatically; manual\nrebuilds on the box need the same --build-arg added by hand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e495fc2d13b64369204ee3ed44c9dd9f71dfa33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/3e495fc2d13b64369204ee3ed44c9dd9f71dfa33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDYzZTA0NjdlNjM1YzUxNzQxMDgxYjE2N2NiMjgzZGY3Njc2NzA3NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/b9f592ab7f00c04a9d010bb2cd39b237c3148356","sha":"b9f592ab7f00c04a9d010bb2cd39b237c3148356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/b9f592ab7f00c04a9d010bb2cd39b237c3148356"}],"sha":"63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/63e0467e635c51741081b167cb283df767670749"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/b9f592ab7f00c04a9d010bb2cd39b237c3148356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T05:09:45Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T05:09:45Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix backend URL construction dropping BACKEND_URL''s own path\n\ncallBackend() used new URL(path, BACKEND_URL) to build every request URL.\nSince every call path starts with a leading \"/\" (e.g. /api/task-context/\nresolve), the WHATWG URL parser treats it as absolute-from-origin,\ndiscarding BACKEND_URL''s own path component entirely — so a deployment\nwhere BACKEND_URL is https://rnd-orion.innodata.com/ext/app/api resolved\nrequests to https://rnd-orion.innodata.com/api/... instead of .../ext/app/\napi/api/... (the double /api/ is correct: nginx strips /ext/app/api before\nforwarding to the container, and Express''s own routes are registered under\n/api/... on top of that).\n\nNever caught in local/mock-uwbe testing because BACKEND_URL there is\nhttp://localhost:4100 — no path to lose, so the bug was silent until an\nactual subpath deployment (RND) exercised it for the first time. Fixed by\nplain string concatenation instead of relying on new URL()''s relative-\nresolution semantics.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7c9452a43bb78c420521928b5262b1ca84991e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/a7c9452a43bb78c420521928b5262b1ca84991e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/b9f592ab7f00c04a9d010bb2cd39b237c3148356","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_ad