com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T04:10:26Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add SPA fallback to frontend nginx config for mode-path deep links\n\nDirect-hitting a mode-path URL (/ext/app/wa/acquisition, /batch-split,\netc. — the URLs uw-be''s external_app_integration actually launches with,\nper mode-path.ts) 404s: nginx:alpine''s default config only does root+index\nwith no fallback, and those paths aren''t real files on disk, just\nclient-side single-spa routes. Only the exact root (which resolves to\nindex.html via the index directive) ever worked.\n\nfrontend/deploy/nginx.conf.template overrides the default config with a\ntry_files fallback to index.html under BASE_PATH, substituted the same\nway index.html''s own placeholder already is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad2e25e55729f093536a819084d5a3f382beb3e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/ad2e25e55729f093536a819084d5a3f382beb3e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/cb2691b32758d3e460ed786b3490926ee2e03d16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/cb2691b32758d3e460ed786b3490926ee2e03d16","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGNiMjY5MWIzMjc1OGQzZTQ2MGVkNzg2YjM0OTA5MjZlZTJlMDNkMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6","sha":"dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6"}],"sha":"cb2691b32758d3e460ed786b3490926ee2e03d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/cb2691b32758d3e460ed786b3490926ee2e03d16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:53:41Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:53:41Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add react/react-dom to the deploy bootstrap''s import map\n\nwebpack-config-single-spa-react externalizes react/react-dom/react-dom-client\nfor any non-standalone build (lib/webpack-config-single-spa-react.js:12) —\nthe deployed bundle expects these as bare specifiers, same as single-spa\nitself, so they need import map entries too. React/react-dom have no native\nESM CDN build (unlike single-spa''s own lib/esm build), so this uses esm.sh''s\non-the-fly CJS->ESM conversion, pinned to 19.2.8 (the actual pnpm-resolved\nversion, not package.json''s ^19.2.0 range head).\n\nreact-dom''s two URLs use ?external=react deliberately — without it esm.sh\nbundles its own private React copy inside react-dom''s shim, creating two\nReact instances on the page (classic micro-frontend footgun, surfaces later\nas \"Invalid hook call\" from hooks, not at load time).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62448d8ffb2001fe47c8228c936225e793653666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/62448d8ffb2001fe47c8228c936225e793653666"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGRhY2JmMzgwMDM1NzY5ODMxMTZlM2NmNzM1YmVmZDkwMGMwMzM1YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/4503a6db61b798d949755768041dc2b4fc705b46","sha":"4503a6db61b798d949755768041dc2b4fc705b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/4503a6db61b798d949755768041dc2b4fc705b46"}],"sha":"dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/dacbf38003576983116e3cf735befd900c0335b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/4503a6db61b798d949755768041dc2b4fc705b46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:43:55Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:43:55Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix broken import map in frontend deploy bootstrap HTML\n\ntype=\"importmap-injector\" isn''t a real script type browsers recognize as\nan import map (the spec type is \"importmap\"), and the bootstrap script\nwasn''t type=\"module\" either — so the bare ''single-spa'' specifier in\nimport(''single-spa'') had nothing to resolve against, breaking the app in\nany real browser (TypeError: Failed to resolve module specifier\n''single-spa''). Modern browsers support import maps natively, so the\nunused @single-spa/import-map-injector script tag is also removed rather\nthan fixed, since its actual API contract was never verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1ab55300ec983a43f6e963af208e1d17e367863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/f1ab55300ec983a43f6e963af208e1d17e367863"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/4503a6db61b798d949755768041dc2b4fc705b46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https: