":"2026-08-20T15:23:26Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:23:26Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix deploy target domain and manual-deploy.sh env-file collision risk\n\nrnd-fe-unifiedworkflow.innodata.com is dead; the real domain is\nrnd-orion.innodata.com (backend: rnd-be-orion.innodata.com). Renamed the\nnginx snippet and updated every reference in README/compose/Dockerfile.\n\nAlso renamed manual-deploy.sh''s expected compose env-file from .env to\ndeploy.env (--env-file explicit on every docker compose call), mirroring\nthe fix already applied to uw-be''s own manual-deploy.sh after a real\nincident where a same-named file collided with a live app''s real .env.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"930f40c2f9f13a7fd9dfdda6c0b77b23b57c89e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/930f40c2f9f13a7fd9dfdda6c0b77b23b57c89e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/ed7e940fed9a644905f275421f9f5aabc03e842d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/re