p/git/trees/f83cda6d8b0723d164938b427170d177e34e5429"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/ec4efe995df61210ced000f64153f8c2e09c369a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/ec4efe995df61210ced000f64153f8c2e09c369a","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKGVjNGVmZTk5NWRmNjEyMTBjZWQwMDBmNjQxNTNmOGMyZTA5YzM2OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18","sha":"368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18"}],"sha":"ec4efe995df61210ced000f64153f8c2e09c369a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/ec4efe995df61210ced000f64153f8c2e09c369a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:20:24Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:20:24Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add Transformation task, RND deployment pipeline, finish real-uw-fe-launch fixes\n\nTransformation task (PDF text -> XML/JSON):\n- New task between by-chapter batch-split and qualification, converting an\n  already-split chapter''s PDF text into structured XML/JSON for RAG ingestion\n  (backend/src/routes/transformation.ts, backend/src/pdf/transform.ts).\n  Deliberately reverses FLUID_APP_DEV_CONTEXT.md''s \"RAG transformation is a\n  separate app\" stance — flagged in README rather than silently overridden.\n- By-chapter batch-split now routes chapter children to Transformation\n  instead of straight to qualification; Transformation''s own completion\n  routes onward to qualification.\n- Qualification''s viewer switches from the PDF iframe to a plain-text\n  structured-content view when meta_data.content_format is xml/json, fetched\n  via a new backend content-proxy route (avoids browser CORS on the signed\n  download URL).\n- Rewrote pdf/split.ts''s extractPerPageText to use direct vendored-pdf.js\n  access (matching the existing outline-reading technique) instead of\n  pdf-parse''s own wrapper, which was unreliable against pdf-lib-produced\n  chunks — the first thing that ever re-parsed a split chunk''s own bytes.\n- New RAGFLOW workflow-creation script (create_ragflow_workflow.php) for\n  real-uw-be testing, alongside (not replacing) MAINFLOW/CHAPTERFLOW.\n\nDeployment (new):\n- Dockerfiles for both packages, docker-compose.deploy.yml, manual-deploy.sh,\n  and a CI/CD pipeline (.github/workflows/ci.yml + deploy.yml) mirroring\n  uw-fe''s/uw-be''s shape, targeting rnd-fe-unifiedworkflow.innodata.com under\n  /ext/app/wa (frontend) and /ext/app/api (backend).\n- Hand-authored frontend/deploy/index.html: standalone-single-spa-webpack-\n  plugin only emits HTML via a dev-server-only hook and hardcodes an\n  absolute root-relative script path that breaks under a subpath.\n- nginx/rnd-fe-unifiedworkflow.snippet.conf to splice into the box''s existing\n  hand-maintained config.\n\nReal-uw-fe-launch fixes (continued from the prior commit):\n- Acquisition suffixes uploaded file names to avoid uw-be''s \"File name\n  already exists\" rejection on same-name re-uploads.\n- register-file now passes userId through (uw-be defaults to user 1\n  otherwise, breaking ownership of self-registered files).\n- Download screen switched from get-file-task-output (requires\n  file_status=Completed at the queried task, which a passive terminal task\n  never satisfies) to get-task-ongoing-file, matching qualification''s own\n  already-working resolution path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5229643df34b25e23e32631a9c947eee8b5ced53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/5229643df34b25e23e32631a9c947eee8b5ced53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDM2OGYxY2E1OWVlYzY3ZTgyYTliNjE1ZTM2MWMyZDJkOTczYzlmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311","sha":"2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311"}],"sha":"368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/368f1ca59eec67e82a9b615e361c2d2d973c9f18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T12:18:33Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T12:18:33Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Fix real-uw-fe-launch gaps: workflow code pre-fill, active-file resolution, userId/registerFile params\n\n- Pre-fill the workflow-code field from taskContext.workflowCode on\n  batch-split/qualification/download screens — real launch URLs already\n  carry it (task-context.ts resolves it), so requiring an operator to\n  retype it was pure friction (and a source of typos causing \"Invalid\n  workflow code\").\n- Add resolveActiveFile() (endpoints.ts): tries get-task-ongoing-file\n  (\"already claimed via uw-fe''s Assign action\" — the real-world case)\n  before falling back to get-task-next-file-with-start (\"fresh from the\n  DAG, never claimed\" — the original assumption). batch-split.ts and\n  qualification.ts were both claim-only and failed with \"No files\n  available for processing\" against a file uw-fe had already assigned.\n- Thread userId through updateFileStatus/flowBackFileTask — uw-be defaults\n  to user_id=1 when omitted, which silently mismatched the real claiming\n  user and failed completion with \"File is already updated.\"\n- registerFile now sends file_path/file_status (both server-required) —\n  never caught before since every earlier real-uw-be test was blocked\n  upstream by the input_download_url gap before reaching this call.\n\nAll four found and verified by walking the by-chapter flow against real\nuw-be/uw-fe end-to-end, not just the mock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"221236c24ae7e0fabd158941e65d3f48f9098fe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/221236c24ae7e0fabd158941e65d3f48f9098fe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311","node_id":"C_kwDOT4AlcNoAKDJiZmJmYzY5YTY2MzliZjI1MzQ2YWQ2YzBiZWU3ZWJiOWMxNjAzMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commit/baf7c6fc195853661f794f07e969111aa16e0b98","sha":"baf7c6fc195853661f794f07e969111aa16e0b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/baf7c6fc195853661f794f07e969111aa16e0b98"}],"sha":"2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/2bfbfc69a6639bf25346ad6c0bee7ebb9c160311"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/commits/baf7c6fc195853661f794f07e969111aa16e0b98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T11:24:50Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T11:24:50Z","email":"j2v@innodata.com","name":"John Paul Perez"},"message":"Add by-chapter batch-split and fix task-context resolution for file-less launches\n\n- backend/pdf/split.ts: by-chapter split method, preferring PDF outline/\n  bookmark detection over page-text scanning (verified against a real\n  2103-page multi-book PDF whose chapter titles are graphics, not text, on\n  their own pages but are real text in the embedded outline).\n- backend/routes/batch-split.ts: splitMethod param, routes by-chapter\n  children to a QUALIFICATION task instead of download-ready/manual-fix.\n- Qualification screen: native PDF viewer (iframe) and a free-form metadata\n  editor over the existing update-file-meta-data wiring.\n- task-context.ts: resolve fileId/jobId/etc. server-side via\n  get-task-ongoing-file when a launch URL has no file_id (uw-fe''s real\n  external-app launch URLs never include one) instead of only handling the\n  ACQUISITION no-file-yet case.\n- mock-uwbe: added get-task-next-file-with-start and in-memory meta_data\n  persistence so the above is actually exercisable against the mock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"564e0bc03021c80dee20efad9aca90f5ae2ca46c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/trees/564e0bc03021c80dee20efad9aca90f5ae2ca46c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j2v-inno/polymorphApp/git/commits/baf7c6fc195853661f794f07e969111aa16e0b98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218719556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j2v-inno","id":218719556,"login":"j2v-inno","node_id":"U_kgDODQllRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j2v-inno/subs