","committedDate":"2026-08-14T07:29:11Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:12:23.288Z","repositoryId":1333921072,"sha":"59eceed0e724b4460dfa5f1e370c8c52d6d26442"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:12:23.288Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/329305b275cf5108c245678d9a0099c8be97fdae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:42:50Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:42:50Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"message":"feat: quishing (QR phishing) simulation — full end-to-end\n\nBackend (new app: quishing/):\n- Models: QuishingTemplate, QuishingCampaign, QuishingResult\n- QR generator (utils.py): base64 + file-based rendering\n- Email sender with variable substitution ({{ qr_url }}, {{ tracking_url }}, {{ employee_name }})\n- Tracking endpoint: /qr/track/<token>/ — records scan, redirects to landing\n- Landing page: fake login styled like NISR portal (no password captured)\n- Submit handler: CSRF-exempt, records submission event, never stores credentials\n- Education page: debrief with red flags + guidance\n- Console API: CRUD for templates, campaigns, results\n- Admin registration for Django admin access\n\nFrontend:\n- ConsoleQuishingPage: 3 tabs (Campaigns, Templates, Results)\n- Full CRUD on templates and campaigns, including edit + status change\n- Results table with scan/submit tracking\n- Nav item \"Quishing\" in console sidebar\n\nInfra:\n- nginx.conf: proxy /qr/ → backend\n- requirements.txt: qrcode[pil]\n- settings.py: PORTAL_URL, quishing in INSTALLED_APPS\n- config/urls.py: registered quishing routes\n\nSafe design:\n- No passwords are ever captured or stored\n- Submit handler records only \"a submission happened\"\n- Landing page has no password input\n- CSRF-exempt because external visitors have no session","tree":{"sha":"632a11bfc0023f98ad9ab1ce30253ef79bbd579b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/trees/632a11bfc0023f98ad9ab1ce30253ef79bbd579b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/commits/329305b275cf5108c245678d9a0099c8be97fdae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/329305b275cf5108c245678d9a0099c8be97fdae","node_id":"C_kwDOT4IFMNoAKDMyOTMwNWIyNzVjZjUxMDhjMjQ1Njc4ZDlhMDA5OWM4YmU5N2ZkYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9","sha":"75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9"}],"sha":"329305b275cf5108c245678d9a0099c8be97fdae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/329305b275cf5108c245678d9a0099c8be97fdae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:55:46Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:55:46Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"message":"feat: phishing simulation end-to-end + reading-time tracking\n\nPhishing:\n- Send HTML emails with variable substitution\n  ({{ campaign_id }}, {{ employee_id }}, {{ tracking_url }})\n- Add structured logging for every send\n- Track delivery success/failure per employee\n\nTraining:\n- Add reading_started_at / reading_completed_at to WaveAssignment\n- New StartQuizView: separates reading phase from quiz phase\n- CoursePage now shows chapters only + \"Start Quiz\" button\n- QuizPage runs the quiz with focus control\n\nConsole & Routing:\n- Fix nested quiz route bug in App.tsx\n- Add course alias URL for backward compatibility\n\nSecurity:\n- Move email credentials to environment variables\n- Add .env to .gitignore\n\nFixes:\n- 404 on /api/waves/<id>/course/ (now resolves)\n- Absolute route path error from React Router\n- Email link now contains real IDs (not {{ }})","tree":{"sha":"156f888bc7395beb0db5e280a88267a748c37b59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/trees/156f888bc7395beb0db5e280a88267a748c37b59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/commits/75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9","node_id":"C_kwDOT4IFMNoAKDc1YzI2MWQwODQyMGM2ZTBjMmQ4MzgzZDA4YzM1YTRiZDE4N2NkZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/7c0c8af97ee078025c89e80b3497ba8b51ee0bb8","sha":"7c0c8af97ee078025c89e80b3497ba8b51ee0bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/7c0c8af97ee078025c89e80b3497ba8b51ee0bb8"}],"sha":"75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/75c261d08420c6e0c2d8383d08c35a4bd187cdf9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/7c0c8af97ee078025c89e80b3497ba8b51ee0bb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:50:07Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:50:07Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"message":"feat: two-phase course flow (reading + quiz) with time tracking\n\nBackend:\n- Add reading_started_at / reading_completed_at to WaveAssignment\n- Add reading_duration_seconds computed property\n- WaveCourseView now marks reading_started_at on first open\n- New StartQuizView: marks reading_completed_at, creates attempt\n- New URL: POST /api/waves/<id>/start-quiz/\n- New alias: GET /api/waves/<id>/course/ (backward compat)\n- CourseDetailSerializer returns chapters only (no questions)\n\nFrontend:\n- CoursePage: reading-only view + \"Start Quiz\" button\n- QuizPage: NEW - quiz phase with focus control\n- App.tsx: fix nested route bug (quiz route was inside /console)\n- ProtectedRoute wraps review + quiz pages\n\nDocker:\n- Bind-mount backend code into containers (host↔container sync)\n- Remove frontend dist bind-mount (was overriding built image)\n\nFixes:\n- No more 404 on /api/waves/<id>/course/\n- No more \"Absolute route path nested under /console\" error\n- Passed courses now visible in Completed tab\n- Reading time recorded before quiz starts","tree":{"sha":"38e534520f72243f70f24933facb080d6a1c55c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/trees/38e534520f72243f70f24933facb080d6a1c55c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/commits/7c0c8af97ee078025c89e80b3497ba8b51ee0bb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/7c0c8af97ee078025c89e80b3497ba8b51ee0bb8","node_id":"C_kwDOT4IFMNoAKDdjMGM4YWY5N2VlMDc4MDI1Yzg5ZTgwYjM0OTdiYThiNTFlZTBiYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/cf8576583619c0900ea34733e37fff357cd59b7c","sha":"cf8576583619c0900ea34733e37fff357cd59b7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/cf8576583619c0900ea34733e37fff357cd59b7c"}],"sha":"7