emplates, and results tabs\n- Added Send Phishing Emails button to console\n- Added Edit Template functionality in console\n- Added PhishingTemplateDetailView API endpoint\n- Updated console_urls.py with template detail route\n- Added timestamp display in results tab\n- Fixed duplicate phishing navigation item","tree":{"sha":"a5c53fd9c5f4dbf12ef8c6d11844ae644b5952a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/trees/a5c53fd9c5f4dbf12ef8c6d11844ae644b5952a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/commits/b08a001d562b6334927165a10bd06baf10e9c0fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/b08a001d562b6334927165a10bd06baf10e9c0fe","node_id":"C_kwDOT4IFMNoAKGIwOGEwMDFkNTYyYjYzMzQ5MjcxNjVhMTBiZDA2YmFmMTBlOWMwZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/21cb9f0498baf2cb3921eec2eeaa1d35240045d7","sha":"21cb9f0498baf2cb3921eec2eeaa1d35240045d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/21cb9f0498baf2cb3921eec2eeaa1d35240045d7"}],"sha":"b08a001d562b6334927165a10bd06baf10e9c0fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/b08a001d562b6334927165a10bd06baf10e9c0fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commits/21cb9f0498baf2cb3921eec2eeaa1d35240045d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:41:10Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:41:10Z","email":"nconstantc@gmail.com","name":"nconstantc"},"message":"NISR Security Awareness Platform - Full Implementation\n\n## Core Features\n- Complete phishing simulation module with templates, campaigns, and tracking\n- Employee reporting system for suspicious emails\n- Automated badge awarding system with signals\n- Course management with chapters, questions, and waves\n- NISR branding (logo, colors, favicon)\n\n## Language & UI\n- Removed all Russian language, English-only interface\n- NISR brand colors (Dark Blue #1a2a6c, Sky Blue #4a90d9)\n- Custom NISR logo and favicon\n- Employee dashboard with badges link\n\n## Badges Created\n- Password Security Training\n- Data Protection Champion\n- Document Sharing Champion\n\n## Courses Created\n- Cybersecurity Fundamentals\n- Password Security\n- Data Protection and Privacy\n- Document Sharing Awareness\n- Phishing Awareness Test\n\n## Phishing Templates\n- Password Expiry Alert\n- Document Sharing Request\n- Training Reminder\n- HR Policy Update\n- IT System Update Alert\n\n## Technical Features\n- PDF certificate download (text version)\n- Email SMTP configuration with Gmail\n- At-risk employee tracking\n- Phishing click tracking with educational redirect\n- Nginx configuration for phishing routes\n\n## Database\n- PostgreSQL with Docker\n- Migrations for all apps\n- Signal-based badge awarding\n\n## Deployment\n- Docker Compose setup\n- Environment variables configured\n- Port 8090 accessible\n- All containers running","tree":{"sha":"02ef9c9e2a698b2cbced59ed98f25f31c27da369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/trees/02ef9c9e2a698b2cbced59ed98f25f31c27da369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/git/commits/21cb9f0498baf2cb3921eec2eeaa1d35240045d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-security-awareness-platform/commit/21cb9f0498baf2cb3921eec2eeaa1d35240045d7","node_id":"C_kwDOT4IFMNoAKDIxY2I5ZjA0OThiYWYyY2IzOTIxZWVjMmVlYWExZDM1MjQwMDQ1ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nconstantc/nisr-securi