github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-v-sebastian/multi-tenant-ai-assistant-builder/commits/78fbebc23cbef149fce6234de1859ebc7bc21a35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:51:32Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:51:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement multi-tenant assistant builder (Phases 1-5)\n\nPhase 1: Supabase schema SQL (001_initial_schema.sql) with RLS policies\non tenants + eval_logs; extend supabase_client.py with create_tenant,\nget_tenant, verify_tenant_passkey (bcrypt), update_tenant_status,\nupsert_tenant_config, save_eval_log, set_rls_context; add bcrypt + PyJWT\nto requirements.txt; 15 new unit tests.\n\nPhase 2: src/storage.py with upload_pdf, upload_eval_csv, get_pdf_url\nagainst Supabase Storage buckets (pdfs / eval-csvs); app.py hooks call\nthese after indexing / CSV parse when tenant is authenticated; 9 new tests.\n\nPhase 3: render_tenant_tab() (Create / Sign-in flows, bcrypt passkey),\n_load_tenant_into_session() helper; tenant_name added to initialize_state;\nKB/Chat/Evals tabs locked until authenticated; 5 new tests.\n\nPhase 4: update_tenant_status(INGESTED) after index build;\nsave_eval_log + update_tenant_status(EVALUATED) after eval run;\nupsert_tenant_config on Save retrieval settings; Publish button\n(EVALUATED → PUBLISHED) with share URL persistence;\n_render_tenant_sidebar_badge() with lifecycle colour coding.\n\nPhase 5: src/share.py — generate_share_token / verify_share_token\n(HMAC-SHA256 HS256 JWT, tenant_id claim, no expiry); jwt_secret /\napp_base_url added to AppConfig + load_config + .env.example; 10 new tests.\n\nAll 60 tests pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: paul-v-sebastian <73991045+paul-v-sebastian@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6728d671e74bf8a6731dd4f2c9739f0e2659b799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-v-sebastian/multi-tenant-ai-assistant-builder/git/trees/6728d671e74bf8a6731dd4f2c9739f0e2659b799"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-v-sebastian/multi-tenant-ai-assistant-builder/git/commits/78fbebc23cbef149fce6234de1859ebc7bc21a35","verification":{"payload":"tree 6728d671e74bf8a6731dd4f2c9739f0e2659b799\nparent ab489c238bb167a1c5ce4a13a9dd6fdbf6862f56\nauthor copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1787050292 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787050292 +0000\n\nfeat: implement multi-tenant assistant builder (Phases 1-5)\n\nPhase 1: Supabase schema SQL (001_initial_schema.sql) with RLS policies\non tenants + eval_logs; extend supabase_client.py with create_tenant,\nget_tenant, verify_tenant_passkey (bcrypt), update_tenant_status,\nupsert_tenant_config, save_eval_log, set_rls_context; add bcrypt + PyJWT\nto requirements.txt; 15 new unit tests.\n\nPhase 2: src/storage.py with upload_pdf, upload_eval_csv, get_pdf_url\nagainst Supabase Storage buckets (pdfs / eval-csvs); app.py hooks call\nthese after indexing / CSV parse when tenant is authenticated; 9 new tests.\n\nPhase 3: render_tenant_tab() (Create / Sign-in flows, bcrypt passkey),\n_load_tenant_into_session() helper; tenant_name added to initialize_state;\nKB/Chat/Evals tabs locked until authenticated; 5 new tests.\n\nPhase 4: update_tenant_status(INGESTED) after index build;\nsave_eval_log + update_tenant_status(EVALUATED) after eval run;\nupsert_tenant_config on Save retrieval settings; Publish button\n(EVALUATED → PUBLISHED) with share URL persistence;\n_render_tenant_sidebar_badge() with lifecycle colour coding.\n\nPhase 5: src/share.py — generate_share_token / verify_share_token\n(HMAC-SHA256 HS256 JWT, tenant_id claim, no expiry); jwt_secret /\napp_base_url added to AppConfig + load_config + .env.example; 10 new tests.\n\nAll 60 tests pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: paul-v-sebastian <73991045+paul-v-sebastian@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhDk0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPfYQAHqJYv6UCwfPXBuXQpFJHPY4\nHXMZAFU60MQBnKbJDbCd7TQDWmWVeyOv1NAxoTJNUDJQrvYxBaBfsqgPLmuWuhJS\nYsEX7MZZb1FCTgqQ91FujT7wtqQgdR1a599D57VltwdbTS8NYhAn/rXS/Re5e0UF\nd8Od+BdrHU06teGj1hoA0ty9RCqmXS2J3txwmdVeIfl5LZK9iC2oLHaoMmAHTISJ\nBrVADReMYdseaxUa5/o4oF5IfQqF1Rtx2peA7x9R6H9aQpWr8VaPlUyXnw81DRVv\nw42fFtlSST0//zAWaG+nQMDPUrDPb6BuMMRsnOwbn0QjfN2ckMnhwgELFlhEXySM\nTMAe1JOYNMqYDQJrSqqOthZp0NqubfmEMTG7q6ZmvgLIot+6HAZN08BgFu9kosV9\nBLOGggkMPfffSww1cKgIkC5UJdKVg5IjkB4OEAVXX+SnSrpbMDrFHxG0nNfIPvdV\nYtYB06zxTYu0kRNSM4kf119I9JCPNFW6Gg1aupIS5GfEbM755J+dApITDl7VNJh5\n4eCAJbu94krYEF76/rIDCb2+aFhFBsXcnuJfpj87wfadiZ3jghTvSR8g3dyfNWxR\nWxoVg+p/9VsCxFO70bNNaK9DVTIc4mqtbwRKQPtHkAYpEJz0fXsAqM8/4WY4ObP+\nUGYgjSSn9XvQK5E6pC0P\n=cFOS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T10:51:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_