ests pass\n\nCo-authored-by: paul-v-sebastian <73991045+paul-v-sebastian@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9357464aad0764762e2e832ed534567214930952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-v-sebastian/multi-tenant-ai-assistant-builder/git/trees/9357464aad0764762e2e832ed534567214930952"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-v-sebastian/multi-tenant-ai-assistant-builder/git/commits/444465a509373d8734c81cdd8f1b990f5784bfca","verification":{"payload":"tree 9357464aad0764762e2e832ed534567214930952\nparent 00cb74834c526267f17538ee6563cb913d08cd97\nauthor copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1786702794 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786702794 +0000\n\nfeat: restructure UI to single-pane ChatGPT-style layout\n\n- Replace 3-pane shell (left/center/right) with a single full-width chat pane\n- Fixed top bar: app title left, ⚙️ gear icon right (HTML + JS-triggered hidden button)\n- @st.dialog settings modal: index name, top_k, min confidence, clear conversation, doc remove\n- Chat messages: right-aligned user bubbles, left-aligned assistant plain text\n- Citation chips: compact ''file.pdf · p.N'' format with CSS hover tooltip showing chunk text\n- (i) info icon per assistant message: JS popover showing retrieval metrics on click\n- ''No relevant info'' responses styled in muted/amber tone\n- Empty state: centered greeting + suggestion chips\n- File attachment chip above input when PDF is indexed (with × remove button)\n- Compact file uploader below chat for attach/replace\n- Per-message sources and metrics stored in message dict\n- All backend logic (ingest_pdf, retrieval, config, services) unchanged\n- All 5 tests pass\n\nCo-authored-by: paul-v-sebastian <73991045+paul-v-sebastian@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfuvKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeXUQAJxEomlSvDkd6ChTcOj49JCe\nJugDxMkeaZELJzjpR2bO7Xb09Mil5YUiMM8qRqTFHqbvzlizTU4+FnLIiJak5PJ5\n//fw97BJQhqET042xK