 switch: document the nested switch in the MEDIUM case\n- reflection: mention the wrong-argument IllegalArgumentException\n- test count confirmed at 51 (surefire reports tests=\"0\" per class\n  because of nested-class reporting)\n- decorator and SCM totals re-checked against real output","tree":{"sha":"774292ccbbaf251bfd764358e146bd83da3e4381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/git/trees/774292ccbbaf251bfd764358e146bd83da3e4381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/git/commits/5c8b4b9073eabf6c688f1bb85973218c12d3c498","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57363532?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegules","id":57363532,"login":"guilhermegules","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYzNTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegules/sandbox/commit/5c8b4b9073eabf6c688f1bb85973218c12d3c498","node_id":"C_kwDOT4UTddoAKDVjOGI0YjkwNzNlYWJmNmM2ODhmMWJiODU5NzMyMThjMTJkM2M0OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegules/sandbox/commit/974f735c6b94a52f7767904d75055a6e68455778","sha":"974f735c6b94a52f7767904d75055a6e68455778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/commits/974f735c6b94a52f7767904d75055a6e68455778"}],"sha":"5c8b4b9073eabf6c688f1bb85973218c12d3c498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/commits/5c8b4b9073eabf6c688f1bb85973218c12d3c498"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57363532?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegules","id":57363532,"login":"guilhermegules","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYzNTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/commits/974f735c6b94a52f7767904d75055a6e68455778/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:07:10Z","email":"guilhermegules@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Gules Moreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:07:10Z","email":"guilhermegules@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Gules Moreira"},"message":"feat: add IF Alternatives lesson (14 decision techniques) on Java 25\n\nStudy project cataloguing 14 ways to express a decision, each a runnable\ndemo plus the failure mode its tradeoffs claim:\n\n- basic: if/else chain, switch (and the range checks a switch cannot do),\n  SCM branches simulated as a runtime branch flag\n- generic: enums, maps, properties, reflection, annotations, math\n- elegant: if objects, functional pipeline, composable decorators\n- polymorphism: instanceof/record patterns vs sealed types with each\n  subtype carrying its own rule\n\nMaven, Java 25, JUnit Jupiter 6, no runtime dependencies. 51 tests assert\neach technique''s decision and its edge case (renamed method, renamed enum\nconstant, typo''d map key, unmapped flag bit, unhandled subtype). README\ncovers the rationale, the pros/cons table, the performance-freedom\ntradeoff of the elegant options, and the tradeoffs checklist.","tree":{"sha":"b7dcbc3022596b62bc0e7814865d45d469904f92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/git/trees/b7dcbc3022596b62bc0e7814865d45d469904f92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegules/sandbox/git/commits/974f735c6b94a52f7767904d75055a6e68455778","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57363532?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegules","id":57363532,"login":"guilhermegules","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYzNTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegules/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g