hub.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/devtools/commits/f9066fcc59952f6fc66480fd9a1f9ace982d320d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:28:08Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:28:08Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"pools: one pre-4.7 warning from the exposed orchestrator version\n\nThe passive probe reads the version orchestrator v4.7 exposes on\n__NF_ORCHESTRATOR__.storage.__NATIVE_FEDERATION__ (native-federation/\norchestrator#86), data properties only; `get` is never called. It lands\nas optional runtime.orchestratorVersion and provenance.orchestratorVersion.\n\nThe Pools tab warns once, at the top, when that version is below 4.7.0,\nor when none is exposed and no pool carries a stored poolName. Fields no\nlonger say \"unknown\": a copy without a stored cause reads \"(own copy)\".","tree":{"sha":"4ccddd8692aa2e7649c4e1b1cb733d4439b610b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/devtools/git/trees/4ccddd8692aa2e7649c4e1b1cb733d4439b610b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/devtools/git/commits/f9066fcc59952f6fc66480fd9a1f9ace982d320d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"htt