"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/devtools/commits/e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:59:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:59:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"pools: read orchestrator v4.7 poolName and poolCause\n\nThe collector keeps SharedExternal.poolName and SharedVersionMeta.poolCause\n(native-federation/orchestrator#87). A pool''s card takes its name from the\nstored poolName (the pool ID still keys on the first member), own-copy\ncells carry a short cause label, and outcome lines a brief reason: a\nversion conflict names the package, its range and the shared tag.\n\nPools recorded before v4.7 keep the first-member name, read their\nreasons as unknown and carry one note saying so.","tree":{"sha":"a92f7432b164507664e628051e64a52a61f167a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/devtools/git/trees/a92f7432b164507664e628051e64a52a61f167a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/devtools/git/commits/e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevano