"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minhdevtry","id":296043886,"login":"minhdevtry","node_id":"U_kgDOEaVFbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minhdevtry/dsh-markdown-ide/commits/047c7ad3f36c562baad000f9d0d3e27c2f1b9515/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:58:20Z","email":"minhdevtry@gmail.com","name":"minhdevtry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:58:20Z","email":"minhdevtry@gmail.com","name":"minhdevtry"},"message":"fix(markdown): keep single-line blockquote opaque lines, untrack scratch dir\n\nAn opaque line (HTML comment, footnote definition) inside a blockquote was\nskipped wholesale, which lost the line for quotes that were nothing but that\none line — `> <!-- c -->` and `> [^1]: note` had round-tripped correctly\nbefore and started coming back empty.\n\nEncode those again, with the `>` left outside the marker so the serializer\ncannot emit it twice. Multi-line quotes keep the skip: rawHtmlLine is a block\nnode, so one in the middle of a quote splits it into three blocks separated by\nbare `>` lines, which re-encode and grow the file on every save. Losing the\ncomment once is the accepted trade; an unbounded file is not.\n\nTests assert the single-line cases byte-for-byte (the old one only checked for\na doubled `> >`) and that a multi-line quote is unchanged across three saves.\n\nAlso untrack .tmpv/, a scratch directory committed by accident in a05820b —\nit hardcodes an absolute jsdom path and breaks on any other machine.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8e3d44eea72824837d08ef6a3a34ad4ab932581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minhdevtry/dsh-markdown-ide/git/trees/b8e3d44eea72824837d08ef6a3a34ad4ab932581"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minhdevtry/dsh-markdown-ide/git/commits/047c7ad3f36c562baad000f9d0d3e27c2f1b9515","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/296043886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minhdevtry","id":296043886,"login":"minhdevtry","node_id":"U_kgDOEaVFbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/minhdevtry","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/minhdevtry/dsh-markdown-ide/commit/047c7ad3f36c562baad000f9d0d3e27c2f1b9515","node_id":"C_kwDOT4eDxtoAKDA0N2M3YWQzZjM2YzU2MmJhYWQwMDBmOWQwZDNlMjdjMmYxYjk1MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/minhdevtry/dsh-markdown-ide/commit/a05820bc01a9496feff33e2f14549cb893773671","sha":"a05820bc01a9496feff33e2f14549cb893773671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minhdevtry/dsh-markdown-ide/commits/a05820bc01a9496feff33e2f14549cb893773671"}],"sha":"047c7ad3f36c562baad000f9d0d3e27c2f1b9515","url