 S._phase 标记由 renderStatusBar 同线绘制（徽标/挂起计数保留）\n- F-C2d Stop 常显：abort 可见性 = _turnState===\"susp\" 派生或 loading 驱动——digest 间\n  loading:false 不再隐 abort（修按钮闪烁——状态广播先于同批 loading:false）\n- F-C2e _suspCounts 不陈旧：计数随 susp 广播/重发（会话内回合尾 finally + postSuspension\n  282/300 同点）+ settle 触发点（onAsyncSettled）+ webviewReady——reducer 归一化四键\n- 协议文档：WEBVIEW.md §8「消息秩序与忙态收敛」权威锚（C1 增量 question promptId/\n  questionCancelled/atComplete seq + C2 turnState）——AGENTS.md 协议表镜像行\n- 测试：webview-turnstate.test.mjs 新建（happy-dom reducer 4 组——枚举转换/单 writer/\n  Stop 常显/计数不陈旧）+ chat-panel.test.mjs ⑦ host 忙态组 + 桩迁移 _turnState——\n  npm test 140 绿（139 pass + 1 既有 slow skip）\n\nC1 零回退：turn 句柄保底/闩消费即复位/seq/id 匹配/retry 同入口测试全绿；abort 直通红线保留","tree":{"sha":"54a4006949ea67c6909a391172e3bcd248e43ffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/54a4006949ea67c6909a391172e3bcd248e43ffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/2c740058cef4a549442abf4e3bb093e62dcfe146","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/2c740058cef4a549442abf4e3bb093e62dcfe146","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDJjNzQwMDU4Y2VmNGE1NDk0NDJhYmY0ZTNiYjA5M2U2MmRjZmUxNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/cbac1d66a5c8717b4a7f15c507193f5844b5d89b","sha":"cbac1d66a5c8717b4a7f15c507193f5844b5d89b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/cbac1d66a5c8717b4a7f15c507193f5844b5d89b"}],"sha":"2c740058cef4a549442abf4e3bb093e62dcfe146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/2c740058cef4a549442abf4e3bb093e62dcfe146"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/cbac1d66a5c8717b4a7f15c507193f5844b5d89b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:29:32Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"epro