"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:17:54Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: agentState 补带 tasks/goal/pendingReminders 回写槽（AGENT-LOOP §11.7 交付缺口补强——a案）\n\n单例切走再切回同槽（F4）后 tasks/goal/pendingReminders 只能靠对话文本重建——\nagentState() 原只带 engineering/advisorGuard/engDesignTokens，三字段从不回写槽。\n- run-helpers.mjs agentState 补带 tasks/goal/pendingReminders（快照拷贝——内存源\n  _tasks/_goal/_pendingReminders；槽键 tasks/goal/pendingReminders 不变）；onComplete\n  {...agentState} spread 自动携入（panel-callbacks 无需改——核实确认）。\n- panel-session.mjs saveLines 消费 extra.goal/extra.pendingReminders（tasks 行已有\n  extra 接线——三字段同构）：键缺席（abort/finally 保存）保留槽值；键在场（干净完成\n  回合）内存即权威——含空态 []/null 如实写与 goal 工具显式清空。D2 语义仅属\n  engDesignTokens（槽权威独立写路径）——三字段无独立写者，CLI saveSession 同款。\n- test/agent-lifecycle-singleton.test.mjs 补 4 用例：agentState 6 字段/槽回填闭环\n  （agentState → saveLines → 槽 → destroy 重建 hydrate 回填）/键缺席保留/空态即权威。\n\n验证：单文件 node --test 12/12 绿；快层 npm test 96/96 绿（基线 92+4）；lint 绿。\n文件域补登：§11.7 文件域扩展 + panel-session.mjs（saveLines extra 消费——核实发现\nsaveLines 原只接线 extra.tasks——goal/pendingReminders 不回写则 F4 闭环不成立）。","tree":{"sha":"4a1443ddb578cf33f2b73944ff88690e387d50a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/4a1443ddb578cf33f2b73944ff88690e387d50a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/a30b8650b0226e3b93d69c17c3466dad0edc715e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/a30b8650b0226e3b93d69c17c3466dad0edc715e","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGEzMGI4NjUwYjAyMjZlM2I5M2Q2OWMxN2MzNDY2ZGFkMGVkYzcxNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/72dfef040023480da7803723ad5f9095d55d3d08","sha":"72dfef040023480da7803723ad5f9095d55d3d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/7