4ZDZiZDNmNjc2ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/605a9019391c1d72a27bff578d9e7f3088683393","sha":"605a9019391c1d72a27bff578d9e7f3088683393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/605a9019391c1d72a27bff578d9e7f3088683393"}],"sha":"ba18670172ba743e97bea00fde5e8d6bd3f676ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/ba18670172ba743e97bea00fde5e8d6bd3f676ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/605a9019391c1d72a27bff578d9e7f3088683393/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:29:26Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:29:26Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"feat: 父侧 observe/send 运行中异步子代理 (SUBAGENT-OBSERVE-SEND, eng-coder clean)\n\n- observe 动作 (D1/F1): 按 id 查 running 子代理 recent-activity 快照——最近 N=5 回合\n  摘要 (截断抽取 assistant 首行/工具名, 非全量 N2) + 当前工具 (onToolCall 捕获\n  entry._currentTool, 评审#2) + turn/touched + status; readonly 零消耗; queued 占位,\n  done 终报预览.\n- send 动作 (D2/F2): 仅 running 异步可 send——入 entry._injected 队列, 子下回合头\n  (agent.mjs opts.turnInput) 作普通 user 指令消费 (非即时, 评审#3); settled/queued/\n  unknown/sync/cancel-targeted 明确错误 (AC3); send→settle 竞态附\"未投递\"注记.\n- schema/分类 (评审#4): subagent-spec observe/send 动作描述+message 属性+SEVEN actions;\n  subagent.mjs isReadonlyAction=status|observe, isControlAction=cancel|send.\n- runChild + 飞刀 async 引擎各接 turnInput 消费回调 + onToolCall 记当前工具.\n- AGENT-LOOP.md §4 动作表+分类+契约单源同步; 模块地图更新.\n- 新增 test/subagent-observe-send.test.mjs (14 用例) + files.mjs 登记; fast 层 40 测试绿.\n\nout-of-list (报告): subagent-async.mjs (entry._injected 归属 + settle 未投递注记),\nsubagent-escalate-async.mjs (飞刀与 spawn 同池 send/observe 一致性, 防静默无投),\nagent.mjs (子 runAgent 回合头消费——设计所述\"子 runAgent 回合边界\"), test/files.mjs.\naudit: 无 partial/silent/doc-drift; out-of-list 透明登记. advisor code review 3 发现全修.","tree":{"sha":"01fd