:[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/1133491d8f91bab404f68f9e8d70afca491e0064","sha":"1133491d8f91bab404f68f9e8d70afca491e0064","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/1133491d8f91bab404f68f9e8d70afca491e0064"}],"sha":"c35ea11a88057b008a261995c8e9e168a6b86a1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/c35ea11a88057b008a261995c8e9e168a6b86a1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/1133491d8f91bab404f68f9e8d70afca491e0064/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:06:44Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:06:44Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"refactor: runAgent backbone split — stage functions to agent/run-stages.mjs (2026-09-05 layering practice)\n\nrunAgent 427→~190 lines per comprehension-cost methodology; the main-loop\nbody now reads as a named-stage skeleton (per-turn hook → checkAndCompact →\nreminder flush → LLM call → no-tool/tool branches → continue/finalize):\n- agent/run-stages.mjs (new, 260): checkAndCompact (safe-point compaction +\n  rebuild boundary/baseline invalidation + failure degradation),\n  fireEndOfRunDistill (depth-guarded async distillation with separate\n  distillSignal), finalizeAgentTurn (consult cleanup / async pool collection\n  / checkN persistence / guardCarry inheritance — suspDriven passed\n  explicitly), maybeGuardPushbacks (pending-task / verify / advisor guard\n  pushbacks — counters flow back via pb object so resume semantics stay\n  per-run local).\n- agent.mjs 496→312: unused compaction/consult/log imports removed;\n  ContinueError + INHERITED_GUARD_KEYS stay defined here (run-stages imports\n  them back — function-level static cycle, precedent: session-slots).\nVerbatim moves + signature adaptation; agent-core/guards/compaction/distill/\nchat-panel/eng-session/suspension 135/135 