d8bfac9420a2092109370bf589f67ddf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:57:23Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:57:23Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: async subagent — check waiter signal exit, interrupt settle semantics, n-counter carry, spec split\n\nPre-release audit fixes (advisor review round 2, 0🔴):\n- check(id) wait loop now races entry.settled / pool-wake / ctx.signal (CLI\n  waiters parity): wake re-judges depc/stall/no-running guards instead of\n  hanging when a dependency dies mid-wait (T-F1); signal abort returns\n  {done,stopped} so Ctrl+I/Stop is not pinned to the awaited child''s natural\n  completion (T-F1b).\n- interrupt (Ctrl+I) semantics completed: chain filter keeps pool children\n  alive (F2) AND the settle discard branch now exempts interrupt-reason —\n  surviving children settle into the pool (done) instead of being silently\n  dropped, report retrievable via check / suspension digest (T-F2 extended).\n- _asyncCheckN carried across resume (Ctrl+I / ContinueError continue): seeded\n  from history at run start, persisted at run end while continuing or pooled —\n  the model''s check n sequence no longer restarts mid-context.\n- subagent.mjs 546 > 500 hard limit: description/schema payload moved verbatim\n  to subagent-spec.mjs (49 lines); subagent.mjs now 499. AGENTS.md module map\n  drops drifting line counts.\nL2 1199/1199, lint 220 files OK.","tree":{"sha":"a61a7279a1175aae5b2d8c3ba6e67bd98ca6c624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/a61a7279a1175aae5b2d8c3ba6e67bd98ca6c624"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/2416b05d8bfac9420a2092109370bf589f67ddf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/2416b05d8bfac9420a2092109370bf589f67ddf1","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDI0MTZiMDVkOGJmYWM5NDIwYTIwOTIxMDkzNzBiZjU4OWY2N2RkZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/a3aea39423fe4cae5929ddc2565424f64f2360f5","sha":"a3aea39423fe4cae5929ddc2565424f64f2360f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a3aea39423fe4cae5929ddc2565424f64f2360f5"}],"sha":"2416b05d8bfac9420a2092109370bf589f67ddf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/2416b05d8bfac9420a2092109370bf589f67ddf1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a3aea39423fe4cae5929ddc2565424f64f2360f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:14:25Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:14:25Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"feat: VS Code batch — subagent-async split + settings/tool/webview mirrors (2026-09-05)\n\nsubagent-async.mjs module split into subagent-actions.mjs (§19/§19.5\ncheck/status/cancel executors) and subagent-scheduler.mjs (§20 scheduler +\nfile-domain groups); subagent.mjs import/export shim, subagent-async\nre-exports keep the 8-name export surface intact (agent/suspension/setup/\npanel-messages/index untouched). New src/agent-tools/settings.mjs with\nconfig-io consolidation. Tool semantics mirrors (file/git/shared/shell/\nexecute), prompts anchor sync (discipline/main), agent setup + execute-tools\nadjustments, webview md.js/chat.css/ui.js rendering batch, extension.mjs and\nconfig wiring, matching test updates (edit-eol/md/prompts/settings/\nsubagent-scheduler/subagent-async/terminal-bash/git). Docs: RELEASE.md.","tree":{"sha":"92fa3102e1b162fe842a4fe6f0a4a3d158f07ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/92fa3102e1b162fe842a4fe6f0a4a3d158f07ddc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/a3aea39423fe4c