e, not a tool) and fell back to ad-hoc code; the main agent imported the escalate MODULE instead of calling it. Pinned the terminology map in three places: escalate tool description (front-loaded), main.md Escalate section, ESCALATE.md glossary (new §0: escalate = the only callable tool name; 飞刀 = Chinese alias; surgeon = the ROLE of the expert sub-agent, never a tool). Panel cards/reports keep the surgeon role label (user-facing, correct) — the fix targets the tool-call surface, where only ''escalate'' exists. Full suite 540 green","tree":{"sha":"2c51b95afac249ced608c760360dfd0ff8342dd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/2c51b95afac249ced608c760360dfd0ff8342dd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/fe0c05db37b801367505d246923ad868a4774da9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/fe0c05db37b801367505d246923ad868a4774da9","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGZlMGMwNWRiMzdiODAxMzY3NTA1ZDI0NjkyM2FkODY4YTQ3NzRkYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6","sha":"ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6"}],"sha":"fe0c05db37b801367505d246923ad868a4774da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/fe0c05db37b801367505d246923ad868a4774da9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T05:24:45Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T05:24:45Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"docs: escalate direct-call guard — a main agent that has just been READING escalate.mjs''s source tends to anchor on ''module'' and write a node script that imports it instead of calling the tool in its own table (observed live 2026-08-16: user asked 飞刀给deepseek and the main agent wrote a script calling escalate.mjs; user corrected ''use the built-in tool''). escalate description + main.md now state plainly: when the user says 飞刀/fly in <model>, call the escalate tool directly — never write a script that imports the module","tree":{"sha":"8e40015ed6af9d6625b6cf2e1b8fa878a72d2d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/8e40015ed6af9d6625b6cf2e1b8fa878a72d2d1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGFiODEzZTU5ZTFjOGVlMmY4OTI0OWYwN2E2NjU2MWE3MTZmN2M0ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/b4780b69d3cf3fbd499246c31152f3b5da9b3a6d","sha":"b4780b69d3cf3fbd499246c31152f3b5da9b3a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b4780b69d3cf3fbd499246c31152f3b5da9b3a6d"}],"sha":"ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/ab813e59e1c8ee2f89249f07a66561a716f7c4e6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b4780b69d3cf3fbd499246c31152f3b5da9b3a6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T05:17:54Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T05:17:54Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: escalate surgeon hit ''unknown tool verify'' and self-verified via bash node --check/npm test (user 