 (red) after user Stop — user read it as ''stop didn''t work'' (2026-08-16 report: 会诊执行中 stop 停不下来). Diagnosis: the stop chain itself was sound (verified by two new tests: cleanupConsultSessions aborts a parked child; the real agent loop exits on Stop while consult_check is parked) — the real defect was cosmetic-but-misleading: cleanupConsultSessions aborted children WITHOUT marking session.stopped, so settleChild took the FAILED branch (red error card) instead of TERMINATED (clean grey). User Stop is intentional — mark stopped before aborting. consult-stop.test.mjs locks both contracts. Full suite 540 green","tree":{"sha":"517e8b6c12fd8b8854c026fa1da9e610541d1829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/517e8b6c12fd8b8854c026fa1da9e610541d1829"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/b7b7650e246492a8a9d426fcbbf532cbc8b7361c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/b7b7650e246492a8a9d426fcbbf532cbc8b7361c","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGI3Yjc2NTBlMjQ2NDkyYThhOWQ0MjZmY2JiZjUzMmNiYzhiNzM2MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471","sha":"95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471"}],"sha":"b7b7650e246492a8a9d426fcbbf532cbc8b7361c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b7b7650e246492a8a9d426fcbbf532cbc8b7361c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T04:16:20Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T04:16:20Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"release: v0.1.24 — cache-hit fixes (time reminder to tail, machine line keeps transient), tool-pairing 400, escalate gap batch, markdown table escape, 飞刀 simplification","tree":{"sha":"49f349b0ca295f60c9a9c8fb03fd1dbb44e7f073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/49f349b0ca295f60c9a9c8fb03fd1dbb44e7f073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDk1YzA5YTQ2OWMxNjliMWM4NGZkZGFlNjY1MmQyMWY2ZGI5Zjc0NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3","sha":"a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3"}],"sha":"95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/95c09a469c169b1c84fddae6652d21f6db9f7471"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:52:00Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:52:00Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: plugin machine line also keeps transient on persist (same cache-hit mechanism as the CLI report) — reloading a slot must rebuild a byte-identical machine line or provider prefix caches miss on window reload / session switch","tree":{"sha":"41d700dd4dd674ec378bdc9fc7e960276900ae24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/41d700dd4dd674ec378bdc9fc7e960276900ae24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGE2N2U1OTQyNTliODM3NmYwOGQ3MTdhZjhhNzFkMTc4ZjkyM2M4YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6","sha":"fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6"}],"sha":"a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a67e594259b8376f08d717af8a71d178f923c8b3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:35:01Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:35:01Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: provider prefix caches never hit after the time-injection refactor (2026-08-16 regression). Root cause: the plugin reloads the machine line from disk every run (transient dropped on persist), but the time reminder was pushed BEFORE the user input — its position drifted run-to-run (fresh run: [time, input]; next run: [...history, time, input]) so every run''s first request had a different prefix → full cache miss. The same misplaced push sat before the freshMachineLine detection, silently disabling injectContext/MCP/skills/AUTO reminders. Fix: time reminder pushed LAST (after the user input) — tail position can never disturb a prefix; freshMachineLine now sees the true empty history again. CLI aligned preemptively (persistent array was safe, but tail is robust against future disk reloads). 3 new tests lock the contract (time after input, fresh injections run, cross-run prefix byte-identical); plugin 538 green, CLI 545 green","tree":{"sha":"49be6cdd6521da5c083716d823ada4af1de6d447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/49be6cdd6521da5c083716d823ada4af1de6d447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGZlNGFiZmFlZDkyZDExZmE5ZjA4OWI1MWEyOGRlYzAxN2YyYjAxZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75","sha":"128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75"}],"sha":"fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/fe4abfaed92d11fa9f089b51a28dec017f2b01e6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:27:14Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:27:14Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: tool-call pairing 400 on strict providers (kimi hit this live during the first escalate run — ''checklist:87, task:88 did not have response messages''). Root cause: the plugin lacked the CLI''s send-time sanitizer, so compaction splits / interrupted sessions left dangling tool_calls that went out verbatim. (1) ported normalizeToolPairing into provider.mjs chat() — tool results reinserted right after their assistant, missing results filled with a placeholder, orphan tool messages dropped; also hardened the early-return (toolById empty must NOT skip placeholder filling when tool_calls are declared — same hole patched in the CLI). (2) compact.mjs gained the REVERSE tail protection (tail opening with an assistant whose tool results were cut just before it now extends tailStart back over them) in both compactHistory and truncateFallback. 5 new tests, full suite 535 green; CLI 545 green","tree":{"sha":"699c166bf23338c4d22047ee567d39a5aebbb758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/699c166bf23338c4d22047ee567d39a5aebbb758"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDEyODQ2NGJlNTM0MzkzOGJjMTZiZDNmYWU4Y2JmZjI3YTIwMDNjNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/cc0d78189d196123e8d217b50850d5558a6dd5e1","sha":"cc0d78189d196123e8d217b50850d5558a6dd5e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/cc0d78189d196123e8d217b50850d5558a6dd5e1"}],"sha":"128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/128464be5343938bc16bd3fae8cbff27a2003c75"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/cc0d78189d196123e8d217b50850d5558a6dd5e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:23:12Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:23:12Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: escalate (飞刀) gap batch from the three-way review — flown in kimi-k3 t