m/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/20265ea62ceb22dd4ec059f6b204a7cbd7cd3caf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a45a61761afdba477d7e503f08ec9258a209b59c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T10:07:06Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T10:07:06Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"feat: subagent/consultant activity streams into the conversation — the biggest visibility gap (user request: ''see what the children are doing during review''). Subagent and consult children now forward onToolCall/onToolResult to the toolPanel channel under ''sub:<label>''; the webview renders each child as an in-conversation collapsible details block (advisor-block form) that live-scrolls tool activity and collapses when done. Depth-0 guards on the callback fire sites removed so depth-1 forwarding works. Plus the consultation visibility batch: panel header shows ''👥 X/Y answered'' while running, consult cards linger 60s instead of 3s (the reply preview is the output), preview raised 2KB→8KB","tree":{"sha":"9db3bbaea88aae47ac708b1c1784ed8b71bbf942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/9db3bbaea88aae47ac708b1c1784ed8b71bbf942"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/a45a61761afdba477d7e503f08ec9258a209b59c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/a45a61761afdba477d7e503f08ec9258a209b59c","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGE0NWE2MTc2MWFmZGJhNDc3ZDdlNTAzZjA4ZWM5MjU4YTIwOWI1OWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/695969a1cb1cb47e22c77b5632c8c973eeb62a5f","sha":"695969a1cb1cb47e22c77b5632c8c973eeb62a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/695969a1cb1cb47e22c77b5632c8c973eeb62a5f"}],"sha":"a45a61761afdba477d7e503f08ec9258a209b59c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/a45a61761afdba477d7e503f08ec9258a209b59c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/695969a1cb1cb47e22c77b5632c8c973eeb62a5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T09:55:20Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T09:55:20Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: bash tool description is now platform-aware — Windows: the isolated child runs cmd.exe (&& works, cmd built-ins, NUL not /dev/null, prefer node -e for complex logic) while terminal:visible/inject runs in the USER''S shell, often PowerShell 5.1 which does NOT support && (use ; or separate calls). The old description said nothing about which shell — models trained on bash emitted && commands that died in the user''s PS 5.1 terminal with ''not a valid statement separator'' (hit twice in this very session). Non-Windows gets a portable-constructs note for terminal modes","tree":{"sha":"bd0321a0c1d6f131ae37206456a78674b461eca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/bd0321a0c1d6f131ae37206456a78674b461eca3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/695969a1cb1cb47e22c77b5632c8c973eeb62a5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/695969a1cb1cb47e22c77b5632c8c973eeb62a5f","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDY5NTk2OWExY2IxY2I0N2UyMmM3N2I1NjMyYzhjOTczZWViNjJhNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/5dff87f7f09d306f58755d0647c316422b19868a","sha":"5dff87f7f09d306f58755d0647c316422b19868a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/5dff87f7f09d306