,{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/2f2ff3d3a7af9eca3208d6d4b0748b599ef9a9a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T09:41:56Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T09:41:56Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"feat: consult follow-ups from the live review — (D10) answered consults now carry a 2KB replyPreview to the panel: collapsible ''view reply'' block on each consult card, so the user sees WHAT each model concluded instead of status dots only; main.md documents the turn-bound lifecycle (after an interrupt, start a fresh consult — never reference the dead id); watchdog-timeout regression test (hang runner + 50ms budget asserts ''timed out'' and NOT ''aborted'')","tree":{"sha":"32ff12726ece572402e9d21156a0d7a5d7537750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/32ff12726ece572402e9d21156a0d7a5d7537750"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/2f2ff3d3a7af9eca3208d6d4b0748b599ef9a9a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/2f2ff3d3a7af9eca3208d6d4b0748b599ef9a9a6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDJmMmZmM2QzYTdhZjllY2EzMjA4ZDZkNGIwNzQ4YjU5OWVmOWE5YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691","sha":"9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691"}],"sha":"2f2ff3d3a7af9eca3208d6d4b0748b599ef9a9a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/2f2ff3d3a7af9eca3208d6d4b0748b599ef9a9a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T09:37:06Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T09:37:06Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: three findings from the live consultation regression — (N1) consultTurns/consultTimeoutMs were dead config: consult.mjs read ctx.agent.config.agent.* but agent.mjs never assembled those keys into the config object (panel edits never took effect); now wired through with a pass-through test. (2) watchdog timeouts settle as ''consultation timed out after Nmin'' instead of ''(failed: aborted)'' — a timeout is not a provider crash and the main agent should read them differently. (3) consult-base.md budget guidance now carries concrete numbers (~40 turns, 2–5 targeted files expected — not ''small'') plus a brief-paths-can-be-wrong verification hint (GLM hit this live). Docs synced: consult.md→consult-base.md, batch-4 rectification table, D3/D6/D10 recorded as reviewed-and-declined with reasons","tree":{"sha":"dc3959b62124d4d070677ab372f4802fa2c9d62c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/dc3959b62124d4d070677ab372f4802fa2c9d62c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDlhMzg5YzAwZjc1MTlmMDQxM2RkZjFiZTg5YzI0Y2U1ZTFlYjE2OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6","sha":"b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6"}],"sha":"9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/9a389c00f7519f0413ddf1be89c24ce5e1eb1691"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:23:49Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:23:49Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: consultation prompt system — six defects from the review. (A) consultants no longer inherit the full main-agent system.md (coding-agent persona + checklist/task/verify tool references conflicting with a read-only diagnosis); new lean consult-base.md is the system prompt, old consult.md overlay removed. (B) question tool excluded from ALL subagents (depth>0) — a background consultant must never prompt the user and hang. (C) consult-base.md guides budget/focus (main_history first, targeted reads, no full-scan) and (D) local-first over web search. (F) ~500-word reply cap (pasted verbatim into main context). (E) consult_check description warns against batching with dependent calls","tree":{"sha":"456073a4ea513fa4893f8be8aa2bef34b970ce16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/456073a4ea513fa4893f8be8aa2bef34b970ce16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGI0ZGM0NzkyOWZkODM2Yzk5ZjY1NmMzMWE4ZDdmNDJhYzllMzY4ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44","sha":"209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44"}],"sha":"b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b4dc47929fd836c99f656c31a8d7f42ac9e368d6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:14:01Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:14:01Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"chore: gitignore .thincoder/tmp/ (tool-result offload cache — runtime artifacts, never source)","tree":{"sha":"4477a1eefe7761c53c2618d378c7d75db44000dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/4477a1eefe7761c53c2618d378c7d75db44000dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDIwOWZmZDcyZDBlMjY5NjQ3NTc0OWVkZjlhZTAxNTVhNGZkZDNkNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a","sha":"5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a"}],"sha":"209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/209ffd72d0e2696475749edf9ae0155a4fdd3d44"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:11:42Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:11:42Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"feat: expose consultation budget on the panel + fix two regressions — (1) agent.consultTurns and agent.consultTimeoutMs were hidden config.json-only knobs; now two number inputs in the Consult & Advisor card (timeout shown in minutes, stored as ms), full read/push/save wiring. (2) After the 7→5 card reorg split Agent and Consult&Advisor into separate sections, adv-enabled/adv-guard switches fell OUTSIDE agCard''s change-to-save binding and silently stopped persisting — now bound explicitly. (3) removed the agCard \\`|| document\\` fallback","tree":{"sha":"bef405a17e94bf2f87fde1b6ed86bc3c8ce02172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/bef405a17e94bf2f87fde1b6ed86bc3c8ce02172"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDVjNTg0NGYwOGY5YzMyNTM4ZmQ2MmNmYzUyNmVlYjlmYjhlMWYwM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826","sha":"b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826"}],"sha":"5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/5c5844f08f9c32538fd62cfc526eeb9fb8e1f03a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:07:06Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T08:07:06Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"docs: fix stale comment (consult turn budget is 40, not 15)","tree":{"sha":"28af13e698a0d82ae99e009b0eec577e8ca39332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/28af13e698a0d82ae99e009b0eec577e8ca39332"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGI2Yzc3MWU1MDk3NDI0MzM3ZWM1OWQzNjg3MGFhZjQ0N2NiMTY4MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c","sha":"c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c"}],"sha":"b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/b6c771e5097424337ec59d36870aaf447cb16826"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:02:04Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:02:04Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"fix: proxy settings silently deleted on unrelated blur — root cause traced. The 2026-08-15 ''proxy binding'' fix (b0d3a57) never actually landed: its string replace missed (CRLF), so the old \\`closest(''.settings-card'') || document\\` fallback survived, binding autoSaveProxy to EVERY input''s change in the panel. Blurring any field re-posted proxy from whatever was in px-uri — an empty field deleted config.proxy entirely. Now bound explicitly per control (px-uri/px-web/px-model). Also raise consultTurns 15→40: at 15 the consultation children hit the turn cap mid-file-read (both DeepSeek and Kimi died at ''reached max turns'' before reaching a conclusion)","tree":{"sha":"cda182c0d3e429b92686ed1894002498dcc9009f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/cda182c0d3e429b92686ed1894002498dcc9009f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKGM4ODM5MjVkNDRjNmRlM2FmYmY4YmJlOTY1MDU5YmFjMTFjMjM0MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/618856fa09c910480ee61f07d397c2aeaadf31a1","sha":"618856fa09c910480ee61f07d397c2aeaadf31a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/618856fa09c910480ee61f07d397c2aeaadf31a1"}],"sha":"c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/c883925d44c6de3afbf8bbe965059bac11c2341c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/618856fa09c910480ee61f07d397c2aeaadf31a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T06:35:20Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T06:35:20Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"eprom"},"message":"feat: local time + timezone injected into every system prompt — the agent loop''s assembly (covers main, subagents, consult children) appends Current time before the OS line; advisor prompts get the same via withTime() wrapper. Without this no agent knew what today or recent meant","tree":{"sha":"649be3b957868e4f94016ae009fdbf0aa9b3c0e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/649b