,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:22:56Z","email":"liwei@51marine.com","name":"liwei"},"message":"fix: review round-5 — 🟡 badge wiring switched from addEventListener to onclick (elements are rebuilt by innerHTML every render — onclick overwrites instead of stacking); 🟡 md() wrapped in try/catch on the onToken and finish-aborted paths (plain-text fallback — a pathological input can no longer break all subsequent token rendering); 🟡 showAutoConfirm also removes a stale .auto-backdrop (leftover backdrop would block UI clicks); 🔵 active tool panels survive autoCleanPanels (name === _currentTool is exempt — slow bash/reads no longer lose accumulated output); 🔵 _panelTimer cleared on unload; 🔵 fmtK ternary expanded; 🔵 PANEL_PREVIEW_CHARS/PANEL_BLOCK_MAX named constants; 🔵 attachCopyButtons null-guards instead of querySelectorAll?. and drops the empty-result fallback","tree":{"sha":"787be3d25664a2101521f4f3d5d9205bdc797342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/trees/787be3d25664a2101521f4f3d5d9205bdc797342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/git/commits/142a132562a75a7bbf7866255d0b15a2daed95cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/142a132562a75a7bbf7866255d0b15a2daed95cb","node_id":"C_kwDOT4evltoAKDE0MmExMzI1NjJhNzVhN2JiZjc4NjYyNTVkMGIxNWEyZGFlZDk1Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commit/2196c52bc785b58c69b719789e284e469d50af99","sha":"2196c52bc785b58c69b719789e284e469d50af99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/2196c52bc785b58c69b719789e284e469d50af99"}],"sha":"142a132562a75a7bbf7866255d0b15a2daed95cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xinbo-tech/thincoder-vscode/commits/142a132562a75a7bbf7866255d0b15a2daed95cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.co