"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/d83da5c73828e6c46769ab8e0b2b21826626fd00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:33:36Z","email":"adithkayalad@gmail.com","name":"karnan7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:33:36Z","email":"adithkayalad@gmail.com","name":"karnan7"},"message":"Serialize the three deploys into one workflow\n\nThree workflows sharing a concurrency group cancel each other: GitHub keeps\nonly one pending run per group, so a push touching two or more apps silently\ndropped a deploy — the first push did exactly that to the host.\n\nSame path filtering, now computed in a `changes` job and consumed by three\njobs chained with `needs`, so the deploys queue behind one another instead of\ncontending for the slot. always() keeps them independent: one app failing to\nbuild doesn''t stop the others from shipping.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"554fc7281865b2b0be28e579fbcf12c1ca21c38e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/git/trees/554fc7281865b2b0be28e579fbcf12c1ca21c38e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/git/commits/d83da5c73828e6c46769ab8e0b2b21826626fd00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107898221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7","id":107898221,"login":"karnan7","node_id":"U_kgDOBm5lbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commit/d83da5c73828e6c46769ab8e0b2b21826626fd00","node_id":"C_kwDOT4gKi9oAKGQ4M2RhNWM3MzgyOGU2YzQ2NzY5YWI4ZTBiMmIyMTgyNjYyNmZkMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commit/6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967","sha":"6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967"}],"sha":"d83da5c73828e6c46769ab8e0b2b21826626fd00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/d83da5c73828e6c46769ab8e0b2b21826626fd00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107898221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7","id":107898221,"login":"karnan7","node_id":"U_kgDOBm5lbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:30:21Z","email":"adithkayalad@gmail.com","name":"karnan7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:30:21Z","email":"adithkayalad@gmail.com","name":"karnan7"},"message":"Make remote URLs env-driven and add per-app deploy workflows\n\nThe host''s base path and both remoteEntry URLs are now build-time env vars\ndefaulting to the dev ports, so the same source builds for any environment.\nThe slot headers read the resolved URLs through `define` instead of showing\nhardcoded localhost addresses, and the router takes its basename from\nBASE_URL so it works from a subpath.\n\nEach app gets a path-filtered workflow: a change under cart/ deploys cart\nalone, leaving host and products serving what they last published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"782efa6021334103bb57f0e1a23abf0217bb36fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/git/trees/782efa6021334103bb57f0e1a23abf0217bb36fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/git/commits/6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107898221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7","id":107898221,"login":"karnan7","node_id":"U_kgDOBm5lbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commit/6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967","node_id":"C_kwDOT4gKi9oAKDY1MTlmZGQ2NzBjYzczYWQwZWRiZTg0NmQ5ZmM2NjAzOTg4Yzc5Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commit/eb79ce5f95da6b79b8f75404bc7748f915451aaa","sha":"eb79ce5f95da6b79b8f75404bc7748f915451aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/eb79ce5f95da6b79b8f75404bc7748f915451aaa"}],"sha":"6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/6519fdd670cc73ad0edbe846d9fc6603988c7967"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107898221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7","id":107898221,"login":"karnan7","node_id":"U_kgDOBm5lbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commits/eb79ce5f95da6b79b8f75404bc7748f915451aaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:26:45Z","email":"adithkayalad@gmail.com","name":"karnan7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:26:45Z","email":"adithkayalad@gmail.com","name":"karnan7"},"message":"Microfrontend React Vite Demo App.\nhost + products + cart","tree":{"sha":"fcaf17bbb46fbd1297488419448e6d9ed9d4ed67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/git/trees/fcaf17bbb46fbd1297488419448e6d9ed9d4ed67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/git/commits/eb79ce5f95da6b79b8f75404bc7748f915451aaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107898221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7","id":107898221,"login":"karnan7","node_id":"U_kgDOBm5lbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karnan7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karnan7/microfrontends-react-vite/commit/eb79ce5f95da6b79b8f75404bc7748f915451aaa","node_id":"C_kwDOT4gKi9oAKGViNzljZTVmOTVkYTZiNzliOGY3NTQwNGJjNzc0OGY5MTU0NTFhYWE","parents":[],"sha