edAt":"2026-10-09T00:12:53.799Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/a8e48894ea221907d2f5446c7e7fed4e46f0c9ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:05:43Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:05:43Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"message":"Phase 5: DevOps, Docker, LocalStack, CI/CD & Documentation - Project completion\n\nDevOps:\n- backend/Dockerfile: multi-stage build (Maven + OpenJDK 17 + FFmpeg + non-root security user)\n- frontend/Dockerfile & nginx.conf: multi-stage build (Node 20 + Nginx alpine SPA routing + API reverse proxy)\n- docker-compose.yml: multi-container orchestration (PostgreSQL 16, LocalStack S3, Spring Boot, Nginx)\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: GitHub Actions CI workflow (JUnit tests, React build, Docker build)\n\nDocumentation:\n- README.md: Senior Architect level documentation with Mermaid architecture diagram, Docker quick start, tech stack breakdown, and resume bullet points","tree":{"sha":"4deb91203f18e786a5eebbbd6accf4820531aa52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/trees/4deb91203f18e786a5eebbbd6accf4820531aa52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/commits/a8e48894ea221907d2f5446c7e7fed4e46f0c9ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/a8e48894ea221907d2f5446c7e7fed4e46f0c9ae","node_id":"C_kwDOT4mkfNoAKGE4ZTQ4ODk0ZWEyMjE5MDdkMmY1NDQ2YzdlN2ZlZDRlNDZmMGM5YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2","sha":"dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2"}],"sha":"a8e48894ea221907d2f5446c7e7fed4e46f0c9ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/a8e48894ea221907d2f5446c7e7fed4e46f0c9ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:03:49Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:03:49Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"message":"Phase 4: Multilingual AI Note Generation & Export - Complete implementation\n\nBackend:\n- Note entity & NoteRepository: storing structured notes, transcripts, and JSON flashcards\n- GenerateNoteRequest & NoteResponse DTOs\n- TranscriptionService: OpenAI Whisper API with local dev fallback\n- AiNoteGenerationService: Prompt engineering for English (en), Marathi (mr), and Hindi (hi)\n- NoteService: note generation, language switching, search, and Markdown export\n- NoteController: POST /generate/{videoId}, GET /video/{videoId}, GET /, GET /search, GET /export/{videoId}/markdown\n- NoteServiceTest: unit test suite covering generation, multi-language switching, and export\n\nFrontend:\n- NoteViewPage: interactive structured note viewer, English/Marathi/Hindi language selector dropdown, interactive flashcards, copy & .MD export download","tree":{"sha":"0c28d84d9336d7228ecc160e12ec36237276d4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/trees/0c28d84d9336d7228ecc160e12ec36237276d4ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/commits/dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2","node_id":"C_kwDOT4mkfNoAKGRlYzlkMTkyYmEzMGJmNzRhNjQ1NzIxNjZlNDUwYmFkMjkxOTczYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc","sha":"0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc"}],"sha":"dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/dec9d192ba30bf74a64572166e450bad291973a2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:01:38Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:01:38Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"message":"Phase 3: Video Upload & Async Processing Pipeline - Complete pipeline\n\nBackend:\n- VideoRepository: user-scoped find, search, pagination with Pageable\n- ProcessingJob & ProcessingJobRepository: per-step tracking (AUDIO_EXTRACTION, TRANSCRIPTION, NOTE_GENERATION)\n- StorageService & S3StorageService: AWS SDK v2, pre-signed URL generation, LocalStack dual-mode\n- AsyncConfig: ThreadPoolTaskExecutor with core/max pool sizing, queue, and CallerRunsPolicy\n- FFmpegService: FFmpeg audio extraction & yt-dlp YouTube audio download with dev fallback\n- VideoService: upload, youtube import, status polling, async pipeline execution with @Async\n- VideoController: POST /upload, POST /youtube, GET /, GET /{id}, GET /{id}/status, DELETE /{id}\n- VideoServiceTest: unit test suite for upload, YouTube import, and video deletion\n\nFrontend:\n- DashboardPage: file upload drag-and-drop, YouTube URL form, real-time progress polling, search filter","tree":{"sha":"10ab8e1db343cf4b8197e7892410b478f4814d2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/trees/10ab8e1db343cf4b8197e7892410b478f4814d2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/commits/0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc","node_id":"C_kwDOT4mkfNoAKDBhNzQxNDJjZWI3ZTNlNzg0NjFiZmExZDY3MzU1MWY3YzVjODM2Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16","sha":"dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16"}],"sha":"0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/0a74142ceb7e3e78461bfa1d673551f7c5c836cc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:55:26Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:55:26Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"message":"Phase 2: JWT Authentication - Complete auth system\n\nBackend:\n- RefreshToken entity + RefreshTokenRepository with cleanup queries\n- UserRepository with findByEmail, existsBy, updateLastLoginTime\n- RegisterRequest/LoginRequest/RefreshTokenRequest/AuthResponse DTOs with @Valid\n- JwtService: token generation (HMAC-SHA256), validation, claim extraction\n- AppConfig: PasswordEncoder (BCrypt), UserDetailsService, AuthenticationManager\n- SecurityConfig: stateless JWT, CORS, filter chain, @EnableMethodSecurity\n- JwtAuthFilter: OncePerRequestFilter that validates Bearer tokens\n- AuthService: register + login + refreshToken + logout (all @Transactional)\n- AuthController: /register /login /refresh /logout /me endpoints\n- GlobalExceptionHandler: validation errors, auth errors, 404, generic 500\n- TokenCleanupService: @Scheduled daily cleanup of expired tokens\n- AuthServiceTest: Mockito unit tests (register success/duplicate, login, bad creds)\n- Base64-encoded JWT secret in application.yml\n\nFrontend:\n- api.ts: Axios instance with JWT request interceptor + transparent refresh\n- authStore.ts: Zustand store with persist for auth state management\n- LoginPage.tsx: real API call, loading states, error display, password toggle\n- RegisterPage.tsx: field errors, password strength meter, API integration","tree":{"sha":"ada725a15b4e254b08f90f72fdb957abdda56a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/trees/ada725a15b4e254b08f90f72fdb957abdda56a87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/commits/dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16","node_id":"C_kwDOT4mkfNoAKGRjZGFkYjQ5MDIxNzYwMmY1ZDkwNzUxMDgwMTQ5OWU1ZGFkODRiMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f","sha":"0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f"}],"sha":"dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/dcdadb490217602f5d907510801499e5dad84b16"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:26:25Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:26:25Z","email":"video2notes@dev.com","name":"Video2Notes Dev"},"message":"Phase 1: Project setup - Spring Boot 3.x + React + PostgreSQL + Docker\n\n- Maven pom.xml with Java 21, Spring Boot 3.2.5, JWT, AWS SDK, Flyway\n- application.yml with dev/prod profiles, HikariCP, Actuator, Prometheus\n- V1__create_initial_schema.sql: users, videos, notes, transcripts, tags, folders, exports\n- JPA entities: User, Video, Note, Folder, Tag, Transcript with LAZY loading\n- Spring Boot main class with @EnableAsync @EnableCaching @EnableScheduling\n- Dockerfile: multi-stage (builder/dev/production) with JVM tuning\n- docker-compose.yml: postgres, backend, frontend, pgadmin, localstack, nginx\n- React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind: Landing, Login, Register, Dashboard pages\n- .gitignore for Java/Node/Terraform/Docker/IDE files","tree":{"sha":"d36cd581d472140436b4693851b591d0d330d77d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/trees/d36cd581d472140436b4693851b591d0d330d77d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/git/commits/0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commit/0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f","node_id":"C_kwDOT4mkfNoAKDBiYzVjMDE5NDI1MjAzNmJmNzg2MWZhMjZlNzc1YTI0OGE1YTU5OGY","parents":[],"sha":"0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits/0bc5c0194252036bf7861fa26e775a248a5a598f"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/psgaikwad2003/Vid2Notes/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=a8e48894ea221907d2f5446c7e7fed4e46f0c9ae&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A25%3A17.810Z"}');
