it owns\n\nThirteen of the fourteen library READMEs were untouched Nx scaffold text,\nincluding shared/domain and the libraries behind most of the REST and SSE\nsurface. Each now follows the shape server/config already used: what the\nlibrary owns, its key units by name, and a link to the root README section\nand ADR that carry the reasoning. The three app shells get one each, stating\nthat they own no domain logic.\n\nCorrects two errors in the root README:\n\n- The project tree annotated server/health as \"Liveness\". ServerHealthModule\n  is empty, nothing imports it, and no liveness route exists — the library\n  holds the Nest DI and decorator-metadata guard named in ADR-0002.\n- server/config''s link to the root README pointed at #configuration, which\n  no longer resolves; the heading slug is #4-configuration.","tree":{"sha":"f37146e01c5691e69340b58a7cb79ec5899e1d38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/f37146e01c5691e69340b58a7cb79ec5899e1d38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/f8e373e794e32ed66b9a45a39b9750309312ce37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users