@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:56:42Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"chore(console): tighten the console bundle warn budget to 500 kB\n\nApp code measures 322 kB, so 650 kB left more slack than the number was\nworth. The error budget stays at 1 MB.\n\nBoth gates and the script default move together — Angular''s own\n`maximumWarning`, the verify-bundle-budget invocations in CI and the nx\ntarget, and the script''s own default — since a warn threshold that\ndisagrees with itself is worse than a loose one.","tree":{"sha":"2633d1a630ff5394c139be7a3d19e388b7f7ba33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/2633d1a630ff5394c139be7a3d19e388b7f7ba33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/6084db4935282f56cd22e99e85cb8bc90b206fad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_ur