f1db769085cd21891e1f41ece6acd4ade7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/23d61c5d277c622ede74dfd615563ef439715209/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:25:07Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:25:07Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"fix(console): split the bundle budget into app code vs shared infrastructure\n\nLumping Native Federation''s shared-dependency bundles into the same\nnumber as this app''s own code, and gating one 650/1000 kB budget\nagainst the total, was itself the wrong model — that budget predates\nModule Federation and was calibrated for a monolithic bundle where\n\"initial\" and \"total cost of this app\" were the same thing. They\naren''t anymore: shared infrastructure (@angular/core, @angular/router,\nzod, the two sharedMappings libraries) is a one-time, content-hashed,\ncacheable cost paid once per browser, not something a Console feature\nchange can shrink, and not what the budget was ever meant to catch.\n\ntools/verify-bundle-budget.mjs now reports two totals instead of one:\napp code (main/polyfills/styles/this app''s own route chunks), gated\nagainst the 650/1000 kB budget since that''s what a Console change\nactually moves; and shared infrastructure, reported but not gated,\nfor the reason above. The app-vs-shared split is a filename fact\nconfirmed against native-federation''s own bundler source\n(bundle-shared.js), not a guess -- unlike the eager/lazy classification\na prior version of this script got wrong, which files actually get\ndownloaded still comes from asking a real browser, never from a\nfilename pattern.\n\nAlso measures gzip alongside raw: the static server now gzips\ncompressible responses when the request accepts it (every real browser\ndoes), and reports actual wire bytes via Content-Length rather than\ndecompressed body size.\n\nResult: app code is 322 kB raw / 97 kB gzip, comfortably inside the\n650 kB budget -- the \"over budget\" finding from the previous commit\nwas measuring the wrong thing, not a real regression. Shared\ninfrastructure is 1,061 kB raw / 261 kB gzip, reported for visibility.\nThe CI gate no longer needs continue-on-error and blocks for real.\n\nAlso fixed: the verify-bundle-budget Nx target had no explicit inputs,\nso it never invalidated its cache when tools/verify-bundle-budget.mjs\nitself changed (that file lives outside apps/console). Nx''s own flaky-\ntask detection caught this on the first run after the rewrite.","tree":{"sha":"dbde650a852b173f03543c7a3be9823011026e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/dbde650a852b173f03543c7a3be9823011026e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/23d61c5d277c622ede74dfd615563ef439715209","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht