nkops/commits/51c59e506d0008dccde106436e0aaae7678a6a22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:54:31Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:22:40Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"docs(root): upstream decisions, specs, and finalize README\n\nIncludes updates from subsequent commits:\n- Add console bundle observability report\n- Add specs location and methodology details\n- Restore missing images and untracked ADRs\n- Clarify architecture decisions and AI usage examples\n- Update B4 status","tree":{"sha":"ce1f9e2db52b16bffdf6e2f7a2c345d3fa5bc5ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/ce1f9e2db52b16bffdf6e2f7a2c345d3fa5bc5ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/51c59e506d0008dccde106436e0aaae7678a6a22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/51c59e506d0008dccde106436e0aaae7678a6a22","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKDUxYzU5ZTUwNmQwMDA4ZGNjZGUxMDY0MzZlMGFhYWU3Njc4YTZhMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b","sha":"aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b"}],"sha":"51c59e506d0008dccde106436e0aaae7678a6a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/51c59e506d0008dccde106436e0aaae7678a6a22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/62bff2e0e4e9938698bb37003d529bc6c70287bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:40:27Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:40:27Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"fix(console): measure the real bundle size instead of guessing from filenames\n\ntools/verify-bundle-budget.mjs classified files by name (chunk-<hash>.js\nas lazy and excluded, everything else as a shared dep) to work around\nAngular''s own budget check missing Native Federation''s shared-dependency\nbundles. That classification was wrong too: the specific chunk the\n\"/\" -> \"/links\" redirect pulls in isn''t optional on a normal visit, but\nits filename looks identical to a genuinely deferred one. There''s no\nreliable way to tell those apart from a filename alone.\n\nReplaced the whole approach: serve the real production build, drive a\nreal headless browser (Playwright/Chromium) to \"/\", and sum the actual\nbytes every response carried before the Fleet table renders. That''s the\none measurement that can''t be fooled by bundling changes that move bytes\nbetween files without changing what a first visit actually downloads.\n\nThe real number is 1,450 kB, not the 1,190 kB the filename-based version\nreported. Also tried and reverted: skipping zod from the federation\n`shared` config, on the theory it would then be tree-shaken to actual\nusage. It doesn''t tree-shake regardless of where it''s bundled; skipping\nit only stopped it being deduplicated across host and remote, raising\nthe total to 1,732 kB. Not part of this diff.\n\nCI now installs Playwright''s Chromium (cached) and runs the same script\nnon-blocking, same reasoning as before: failing on a real regression\nthis PR surfaces but doesn''t fix would make every PR red. README and\nADR-0014 updated with the real number and what was tried and ruled out.","tree":{"sha":"7baeb1a28e4903693372397a0668549bc7fbd4d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/7baeb1a28e4903693372397a0668549bc7fbd4d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/62bff2e0e4e9938698bb37003d529bc6c70287bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/62bff2e0e4e9938698bb37003d529bc6c70287bf","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKDYyYmZmMmUwZTRlOTkzODY5OGJiMzcwMDNkNTI5YmM2YzcwMjg3YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c","sha":"fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c"}],"sha":"62bff2e0e4e9938698bb37003d529bc6c70287bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/62bff2e0e4e9938698bb37003d529bc6c70287bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:18:04Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:18:04Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"fix(console): correct the bundle-size report to include federation shared deps\n\nThe CI bundle report only summed files referenced by name in index.html,\nso it never counted Native Federation''s shared-dependency bundles\n(_angular_core, zod, the two workspace libs, ...) — built by a separate\nstep, invisible to that check, but confirmed with a real browser session\nto be fetched before the Fleet route ever renders regardless. It quietly\nwent from harmless to wrong the moment those bundles started existing.\n\nThe true first-load total is 1,190 kB raw, not the 123-126 kB the old\nreport and Angular''s own esbuild budget check both showed — over the\n1 MB error budget stated in console''s own project.json. Angular''s\nbudget check only sees main/polyfills/styles; it has no visibility into\nwhat the federation config''s `shared`/`sharedMappings` actually produces.\n\ntools/verify-bundle-budget.mjs is the one place this classification now\nlives — both the CI gate and the PR comment read it, rather than each\nre-deriving which files count and risking drifting apart the way the\nold report already had. Wired as `console:verify-bundle-budget` and a\nnew CI step; continue-on-error for now, since failing on it would make\nevery PR red for a regression this PR surfaces rather than fixes.\n\nCorrected the same \"616.33 kB -> 125.65 kB\" framing in the README and\nADR-0014, which repeated the report''s blind spot.","tree":{"sha":"fbc43b93528846304b07a5daef2eb1e63e3efb0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/fbc43b93528846304b07a5daef2eb1e63e3efb0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKGZhODFhYjI2MmI2M2ExNzFkNzkxMDhkMWUxM2Y5NzJkNWU5ODlhNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4","sha":"b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4"}],"sha":"fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/fa81ab262b63a171d79108d1e13f972d5e989a6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:19:29Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:19:29Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"fix(console): stop the Assistant remote loader from hanging forever\n\nClicking \"Ask the assistant\" spun forever with zero network activity —\nloadRemoteModule() awaits a module-scoped federationPromise before\nattempting any fetch, and that promise was never the one main.ts''s\ninitFederation() resolved.\n\nRoot cause: ASSISTANT_REMOTE_LOADER lived in console/data-access, a\nsharedMappings library built as its own standalone bundle. Native\nfederation''s own package can''t itself be declared shared (it''s what\nestablishes the shared-import mechanism main.ts''s bootstrap import of\nit runs before), so it was getting inlined independently into both\nmain.ts''s bundle and data-access''s — two separate copies of the\npackage''s module state, one of which initFederation() never touches.\n\nFix: moved the token to console/feature-fleet, lazy-loaded application\ncode bundled through the same graph as main.ts, so both call sites\nshare the one instance. Test harness now imports it dynamically\n(satisfies @nx/enforce-module-boundaries'' ban on statically importing\na library the project also lazy-loads).\n\nAlso dropped a bogus \"api\" entry from federation.manifest.json — an\nartifact of native-federation''s init schematic sweeping in every\nsibling app with serve+build targets, including the non-Angular API.\n\nDiagnosed and verified with a real headless-browser run against both\ndev servers (no e2e harness exists in this repo to have caught this at\nthe unit-test level — the substituted loader token is precisely what\nevery other test uses to avoid crossing this boundary). Confirmed:\nclick now fetches Component.js from :4201 and the panel renders a\nreal Triage Surface, with the Fleet table still ticking behind it.\n\nDocumented in ADR-0014 and the README so the constraint (this token\ncannot live in a sharedMappings library) isn''t reintroduced.","tree":{"sha":"75e8d244f00b5631f17158fbcff93e8f75ac8418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/75e8d244f00b5631f17158fbcff93e8f75ac8418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKGI2ODYxOWUxMGY0MzBlNTEwM2I0OGEyNzQxMDhkN2UyN2U4NDE3YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1","sha":"cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1"}],"sha":"b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/b68619e10f430e5103b48a274108d7e27e8417b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:52:04Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:52:04Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"feat(console): extract Assistant panel into a Module Federation remote\n\nPackages the triage panel as apps/assistant (port 4201), a Native\nFederation remote exposing AssistantPanel (libs/console/feature-assistant)\nas a Component Remote. apps/console is now a dynamic host: FleetPage''s\nexisting @defer block mounts a new local AssistantWrapper, which calls\nloadRemoteModule, shows a spinner while it''s pending, and mounts the\nresult via NgComponentOutlet.\n\nconsole/feature-fleet no longer imports any Assistant component directly\n— composition happens at runtime, not through a static import, which is\nwhat lets console/feature-assistant exist as a real type:feature library\nwithout violating the feature-cannot-import-feature boundary rule\n(ADR-0011). See ADR-0014 for the full decision, including why the\ndeprecated @nx/angular webpack Module Federation generators were not\nused in favor of Native Federation.\n\nconsole/data-access and shared/domain are declared shared singletons on\nboth federation configs, so AssistantInvalidPayloadError stays one class\nacross the boundary. AssistantSession now cancels its in-flight request\non destroy (takeUntilDestroyed), not just on reopen, since it''s scoped\nto the panel itself rather than surviving inside FleetPage.\n\nConsole''s initial production bundle drops from 616.33 kB to 125.65 kB\nraw with the panel''s code no longer part of it at any size.\n\nVerified end-to-end at the network layer: both dev servers serving,\nmanifest → remoteEntry.json → exposed Component.js resolving with\ncorrect CORS (no headless browser available in this environment).","tree":{"sha":"0547c40aed9e2e37c5405aba59d26d6ec01918fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/0547c40aed9e2e37c5405aba59d26d6ec01918fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKGNjMzBjMmIyMmEzZDBiZTY0ZTA3NGM5MjA4MDNmOGVkY2ZkYTUzYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b","sha":"aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b"}],"sha":"cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/cc30c2b22a3d0be64e074c920803f8edcfda53a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:51:49Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:51:49Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"docs: add performance bottleneck analysis for 10,000 links\n\nDocuments the next steps and theoretical limits of the current architecture.\nExpanding the system to 10,000 links exposes a massive JSON parsing and DOM\nrendering bottleneck. The analysis outlines how moving to viewport-aware SSE\nsubscriptions and virtual scrolling would resolve the load.","tree":{"sha":"804ea8799779be144372c32b5ee3b37ddb3b8897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/804ea8799779be144372c32b5ee3b37ddb3b8897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/aa4fe5185639b3435081e1b0037c27c40dd65d4b","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKGFhNGZlNTE4NTYzOWIzNDM1MDgxZTFiMDAzN2MyN2M0MGRkNjVkNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/59b03ccccd54ba973dcc34bd90dcac5456c3ab16","sha":"59b03ccccd54ba973dcc34bd90dcac5456c3ab16","url"