gin":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/657f7fb3e89ab471c8daee3cc7c0adf1f2683e2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:35:54Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:45:10Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"test(console): dispatch input event in form harness\n\nThe Link form was recently migrated from (change) to (input) bindings\nto fix an event race condition. The test harness''s `setFormField` helper\nonly dispatched a ''change'' event, meaning simulated typing during tests\nno longer updated the form''s internal state.\n\nDispatching an ''input'' event restores test coverage for the new\nbindings and fixes the failing console spec suite.","tree":{"sha":"1168ef3051d76b48e25fd67143701302fd58a39c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/1168ef3051d76b48e25fd67143701302fd58a39c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/657f7fb3e89ab471c8daee3cc7c0adf1f2683e2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/657f7fb3e89ab471c8daee3cc7c0adf1f2683e2d","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKDY1N2Y3ZmIzZTg5YWI0NzFjOGRhZWUzY2M3YzBhZGYxZjI2ODNlMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911","sha":"2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911"}],"sha":"657f7fb3e89ab471c8daee3cc7c0adf1f2683e2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/657f7fb3e89ab471c8daee3cc7c0adf1f2683e2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:29:06Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:45:10Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"fix(console): bind form fields to (input) instead of (change)\n\nAngular''s `(change)` event only fires when an input loses focus.\nBecause of this, if an operator edited the form and pressed Enter\nwhile still focused in the input, the form would submit *before*\nthe component state was updated. This resulted in the form\nsuccessfully submitting the previously valid state instead of the\noperator''s current, potentially invalid keystrokes.\n\nBy binding to `(input)` instead of `(change)`, the internal signal\nupdates on every keystroke, ensuring the form''s state accurately\nmatches the screen at the moment of submission.\n\nCloses #61","tree":{"sha":"aec93ddf86ac7f6f50df6739954270e06a5376e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/aec93ddf86ac7f6f50df6739954270e06a5376e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKDJiOWE5MjFjMTcwZjJkNzkzOTIyYmFmMmU5ODU1MjM0Y2M3NmE5MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/f8d1eba8e8b992de3722efa06ac834a127460e45","sha":"f8d1eba8e8b992de3722efa06ac834a127460e45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/f8d1eba8e8b992de3722efa06ac834a127460e45"}],"sha":"2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/2b9a921c170f2d793922baf2e9855234cc76a911"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/f8d1eba8e8b992de3722efa06ac834a127460e45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:28:57Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:45:10Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"fix(domain): trim string fields and require sites\n\nZod''s `.min(3)` counts spaces as characters, which allowed a string\nof three spaces to pass as a valid name. By adding `.trim()`, spaces\nare stripped before length validation.\n\nAdditionally, `siteA` and `siteB` previously lacked length constraints,\nallowing empty strings to pass validation. They now require at least\none character.\n\nThis change ensures strict data validation on both the client and\nthe server.\n\nRefs #61","tree":{"sha":"969db30e1aadc5f0e967cbe934cd87286e99cca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/969db30e1aadc5f0e967cbe934cd87286e99cca8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/f8d1eba8e8b992de3722efa06ac834a127460e45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937