ps://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/3f46097b51dc3a72c6b36f9bb2d7ef65b2b86fea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:33:24Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:33:24Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"message":"fix(console): refine UI pacing, navigation, overflow, and sparkline scales\n\nAddress operator UI polish and layout feedback items:\n\n- Aligns button geometry, paddings, and baselines between Edit and Delete\n  actions on LinkDetailPage using design tokens.\n- Supports flexible back routing on FleetBreadcrumb and adds a Cancel action\n  to LinkForm so operators editing a link can return directly to the link.\n- Makes ThroughputBar track and label responsive to container constraints to\n  prevent overflow in grid and property lists.\n- Enriches Sparkline with Y-axis capacity and midpoint scale markers, grid\n  reference lines, and X-axis time markers.\n- Truncates raw floating-point RSSI and SNR telemetry samples to single-decimal\n  precision in the presentation layer.\n- Styles transport failure and unreachable notifications as clear alert boxes.","tree":{"sha":"b9e7015f2bdc0e704d510daf2818c52acb11763a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/b9e7015f2bdc0e704d510daf2818c52acb11763a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/3f46097b51dc3a72c6b36f9bb2d7ef65b2b86fea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"http