s","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/716e52930eb9215b2ba435683373285a60289a88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T23:28:19Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T23:35:26Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"fix(console): keep the offer onscreen while an Action is in flight\n\nAssistantSession.act cleared the Surface on every send and the error arm\nnever restored it, so a dropped connection left the operator the \"Try\nagain\" message with nothing left to try. Only open() clears now; act()\nleaves the Surface up until a reply replaces it. FleetPage renders\nfailure, pending and Surface as three independent blocks, so a message\nappears above a retained offer rather than instead of it.\n\nThe lifecycle both entry points shared — cancellation, the signal resets,\nboth subscriber arms — moves into a private run().\n\nThe round-trip test seeds a second degraded Link so the Link picker\noffers a real choice, and a new test errors an Action, then presses\nagain to show the operator''s picks survived.\n\nRefs #48\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016kPsaBftwJzsMKRym9CRXj","tree":{"sha":"76b7b34681509e59b6e32d35fe9a448f8348246d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/76b7b34681509e59b6e32d35fe9a448f8348246d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/716e52930eb9215b2ba435683373285a60289a88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/716e52930eb9215b2ba435683373285a60289a88","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKDcxNmU1MjkzMGViOTIxNWIyYmE0MzU2ODMzNzMyODVhNjAyODlhODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/1e5b8e1c8b8bd64fa42064f49fc7b82eee3440d0","sha":"1e5b8e1c8b8bd64fa42064f49fc7b82eee3440d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/1e5b8e1c8b8bd64fa42064f49fc7b82eee3440d0"}],"sha":"716e52930eb9215b2ba435683373285a60289a88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/716e52930eb9215b2ba435683373285a60289a88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/1e5b8e1c8b8bd64fa42064f49fc7b82eee3440d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T19:36:12Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T23:35:26Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"feat(console): the operator round-trips an Action to the Assistant\n\nThe action raised by A2uiButton now propagates up through A2uiNode to\nA2uiSurface, which gathers the current Data Model and constructs an\nA2uiActionRequest. This is sent to the backend via AssistantClient''s\nnew act() method, wired up through AssistantSession and FleetPage. The\ntest covers the round trip, verifying the surface is submitted and\nanswers correctly.\n\nCloses #40","tree":{"sha":"987a3c1adb4d8c044f2122e8791796388801c957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/987a3c1adb4d8c044f2122e8791796388801c957"},"url":"h