y implemented and producing Telemetry\nSamples.\n\nRefs #37","tree":{"sha":"cbf6708e698a0596235e0f48ed95548a50a185b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/cbf6708e698a0596235e0f48ed95548a50a185b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/349c52e6662a1c4a686390f561fd7db7b1f0acbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/349c52e6662a1c4a686390f561fd7db7b1f0acbb","node_id":"C_kwDOT4pnL9oAKDM0OWM1MmU2NjYyYTFjNGE2ODYzOTBmNTYxZmQ3ZGI3YjFmMGFjYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/b43405f412df960e4dec87ea604df817ea937945","sha":"b43405f412df960e4dec87ea604df817ea937945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/b43405f412df960e4dec87ea604df817ea937945"}],"sha":"349c52e6662a1c4a686390f561fd7db7b1f0acbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/349c52e6662a1c4a686390f561fd7db7b1f0acbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/b43405f412df960e4dec87ea604df817ea937945/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T12:59:43Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T13:22:00Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"feat(console): measure what one Tick costs, and report the bundle size\n\n- TickCostTracker + summarize() collect median and p95 by nearest rank\n  over a sixty-Tick window, TDD''d as pure logic. record() returns the\n  stats directly (null until the window fills) rather than taking a\n  report callback that fires once in sixty calls.\n- FleetStore.apply() brackets the per-Tick store write with\n  performance.mark/measure via one private applyAndTrackCost() helper,\n  guarded by isDevMode() and a User Timing API feature check — jsdom\n  has no performance.mark, so the guard has to be more than isDevMode()\n  alone, and one guard beats the same isDevMode() check duplicated on\n  both sides of the write.\n- Named TickCostTracker rather than *Sampler: FleetStore already owns\n  latestSample: Signal<ReadonlyMap<LinkId, TelemetrySample>>, and a\n  second, unrelated ''Sample'' in the same class was a readability trap\n  next to the domain one.\n- README reports the measured figures (0.2 ms median, 0.3 ms p95 over\n  60 Ticks, 10-Link fleet, headless Chrome on an i5-9300H) and the\n  production bundle size from the same pass","tree":{"sha":"60a4da6acf457da4b2e59869e40bf57f0ff47109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/60a4da6acf457da4b2e59869e40bf57f0ff47109"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/b43405f412df960e4dec87ea604df817ea937945","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b","id":43937419,"login":"ramvignesh-b","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commit/b43405f412df960e4dec8