M3NDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/commits/060b36a91ccaefb0e2de5b75bc58316d4ed22d8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T08:02:04Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"ramvignesh-b"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T08:08:05Z","email":"github@infra.iamatom.fyi","name":"RamVignesh B"},"message":"docs(console): record bundle budget discipline and refine CI report\n\nRecord the Console''s bundle budget and lazy-route loading discipline in\nAGENTS.md, ensuring future agent sessions keep initial render-blocking\ncode lean.\n\nUpdate the CI bundle report step in ci.yml to separate render-blocking\ninitial chunks from on-demand lazy chunks and static media, clearly\nhighlighting the measured budget status and headroom.","tree":{"sha":"539acf4783ddf04cdf5bdfc4555f9b609bf812bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/trees/539acf4783ddf04cdf5bdfc4555f9b609bf812bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramvignesh-b/linkops/git/commits/060b36a91ccaefb0e2de5b75bc58316d4ed22d8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43937419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramvignesh-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git