"date":"2026-08-21T22:09:39Z","email":"saldigenua@gmail.com","name":"Salvatore Di Genua"},"message":"Add Tailwind CSS documentation, responsive design patterns, and TypeScript advanced types\n\n- Created reference documentation for Tailwind CSS, covering installation, utility classes, custom themes, dark mode, and responsive design patterns.\n- Added a new file for responsive design patterns with examples for mobile-first layouts, grid galleries, and dark mode support.\n- Introduced a comprehensive guide on TypeScript''s advanced types, including generics, conditional types, mapped types, and utility types.\n- Updated .gitignore to exclude specific agent files.\n- Refactored project section in Angular component for improved readability and structure.","tree":{"sha":"17f346f049a74e3d127851e4ab4e882a03f0be0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalvatoreDiGenua/portfolio/git/trees/17f346f049a74e3d127851e4ab4e882a03f0be0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalvatoreDiGenua/portfolio/git/commits/fbec7d23a4c7240ad2ae7af4ea3819b672608681","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SalvatoreDiGenua/portfolio/commit/fbec7d23a4c7240ad2ae7af4ea3819b672608681","node_id":"C_kwDOT4snidoAKGZiZWM3ZDIzYTRjNzI0MGFkMmFlN2FmNGVhMzgxOWI2NzI2MDg2ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SalvatoreDiGenua/portfolio/commit/a3bc158f66908bca0d1c14cc52370653d9f5814c","sha":"a3bc158f66908bca0d1c14cc52370653d9f5814c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalvatoreDiGenua/portfolio/commits/a3bc158f66908bca0d1c14cc52370653d9f5814c"}],"sha":"fbec7d23a4c7240ad2ae7af4ea3819b672608681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SalvatoreDiGenua/portfolio/commits/fbec7d23a4c7240ad2ae7af4ea3819b672608681"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98554731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SalvatoreDiGenua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gith