 refresh/direct navigation.\n- Add all deployed Vercel origins to render.yaml CORS_ORIGINS.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrUj1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb6wQAHZw5VpUOIjjNiMUpdroyajk\npE3eo01jyR66ns11DGwpm1PzMIGT6WXypgfoB8kJy9nVkEUnr1gkk+N0NDIIcy/F\nIjplyRR2051rljCrL02PAE6otqvnELk2ET02LskOy0ncPaW+4YQZC3AGy/m9t8L9\nik0D+g94mdYpRc21aatJFyrAcnKIITz+nRM9HWUzla5EkKHEgUjO7kGlvPhJUaCx\n+qsOYyIuiq5NkZ8XZf/i+MaY89Hhpj80MvAObTpEagUz9w9IfDl99kU+G/5gSDXc\nM3reMvVKTKhVpQOzZyo5eNWMslD1e01Ort0fKOVbrUj1QbxLOad00FOBABVABzc4\nEqTBCULkIWOpM3pGf63Pr5FeVJ0syznSVJiFukVZuHDYV0bHCaHW4r8m+hR7Y9ga\nQ+OapRjcFMUYScXHAIdIqcXFT/++EuR+gcaiupOK4uile4rOArsQ+187jXaybFQK\n9yz7XhtrffJjxwevKXD1xkTYWvEirwe3rusrYyeXEqKxvVlEcvrL8PUzt+MNkYhH\ngmzZiz8DryJwCjm3BHftLj8ZSNSilnB32zzI7S4WSgtq+3K8Tovtc2UTHAUVo6Cj\nuQxexJv8RcB+ED2ZrXsyo0Q5XVczrjzfWACN6JagtBAoyrMcEOORWvyoYGOBw8Pg\ncK+uz8SGX8BQ7NpZiJ+i\n=y8N6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T14:21:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fidelis27/mfe-communication/commit/1321521312d9708bad5f60ffea973c6aa3e519e2","node_id":"C_kwDOT4t7ytoAKDEzMjE1MjEzMTJkOTcwOGJhZDVmNjBmZmVhOTczYzZhYTNlNTE5ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fidelis27/mfe-communication/commit/ceafa5508fadb154cdd7901076eb12e5d1d26a5d","sha":"ceafa5508fadb154cdd7901076eb12e5d1d26a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fidelis27/mfe-communication/commits/ceafa5508fadb154cdd7901076eb12e5d1d26a5d"}],"sha":"1321521312d9708bad5f60ffea973c6aa3e519e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fidelis27/mfe-communication/commits/1321521312d9708bad5f60ffea973c6aa3e519e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45233696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fidelis27","id":45233696,"login":"fidelis27","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjMzNjk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fidelis27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fidelis27/mfe-communication/commits/ceafa5508fadb154cdd7901076eb12e5d1d26a5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:57:17Z","email":"45233696+fidelis27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thiago Fidelis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:57:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: skip already-applied DDL statements during migration re-run (#63)\n\nMySQL implicitly commits DDL, so a migration that fails partway through\nleaves earlier CREATE TABLE/INDEX statements applied even though the\ntransaction rolls back and the migration is never recorded in\nschema_migrations. Re-running it then fails forever with errors like\n''Table already exists''. Treat known already-exists MySQL error codes as\nnon-fatal for a statement and continue applying the rest of the migration.","tree":{"sha":"9ac79677a98b48387891a36ba1f57f6ffe02e45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fidelis27/mfe-communication/git/trees/9ac79677a98b48387891a36ba1f57f6ffe02e45f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fidelis27/mfe-communication/git/commits/ceafa5508fadb154cdd7901076eb12e5d1d26a5d","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ac79677a98b48387891a36ba1f57f6ffe02e45f\nparent a4c9772f6490b4597f5b981207fa890d3bf1237c\nauthor Thiago Fidelis <45233696+fidelis27@users.noreply.github.com> 1789739837 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789739837 -0300\n\nfix: skip already-applied DDL statements during migration re-run (#63)\n\nMySQL implicitly commits DDL, so a migration that fails partway through\nleaves earlier CREATE TABLE/INDEX statements applied even though the\ntransaction rolls back and the migration is never recorded in\nschema_migrations. Re-running it then fails forever with errors like\n''Table already exists''. Treat known already-exists MySQL error codes as\nnon-fatal for a statement and continue applying the rest of the migration.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrUM9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARsAQAErmY6moUoLGBV8cmxgCWwB0\nPC1PKJecxp+kVXBmSpoQINFk3HtS2F5WGLcPUnjR7UQ7JWxrFU0dlFm5vpQ042Ai\nKJFqZlUc4GppRrg1GmiL+nm9L8z2dkp53tcCA0iye1QPI2aexC/uNmyFVOrKScjx\nt5T7pzbqQjznHo+iurxRJ9Jo9vqvcfG1v5TXmgkeDiGpDJbs8qW9usnU0sC2ZH83\n7iP5F5vaqihWyKNuMdLkx5GnyJAv/n0yZ/9PVgas4LVL4m2/DwX4Y2y/taKbvTz8\nmQ2AdT3FxdnDKbL1/VfPfi7ZFLjFCjIC8v/PKFNAkPiLsDn6plcVZEPUGfVjOh4G\nH6+mDsqluQ25bwFLsSD7efAXsv96f2rnPrY6TjSkOO4ZT2851LAZxk2A12+LmLI