/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commits/71b692eae0d061ea82d44a6f828d4c528e1bb847/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:06:14Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:06:14Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Share the approval models and the facts pattern\n\nThe approval engine''s TypeScript contract lived in jp-admin. Phase 2F gave\njp-school the other half of the same flow, and two hand-maintained copies of one\nC# contract is exactly the drift the file''s own header warns about. One copy\nnow, both apps import it.\n\nAdds the types the school side needs: SaveDraftBody, SaveDraftResult,\nDocumentType (which carries the upload rules the generic master shape drops),\nSubmitApprovalResult, and panNumber on the school detail.\n\n.facts moves into the shared stylesheet for the same reason — jp-admin reads a\nregistration and jp-school writes one, and they were rendering the same\nlabel/value list from two copies of the same CSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43bf581bc5a3d959fd50bc0c5b2cfe6d4f6eac66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/git/trees/43bf581bc5a3d959fd50bc0c5b