ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commits/a54b6d6d60ff8e89539825d368b581e235259e74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T06:26:47Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T06:26:47Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Add the approval-engine master keys\n\nrequest-type, approval-status, action-type, document-type, rejection-reason and\nthe two payment masters. The procedure has always served these; the client-side\nlist of keys had not caught up, so a component asking for one was a compile\nerror rather than the 404 it should have been.\n\nrejection-reason is scoped by request type — pass the request type id as the\nparent, or a teacher request offers school rejection reasons.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f81065efea36f88f810e0edd4a49f467f1c0e4b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/git/trees/f81065efea36f88f810e0edd4a49f467f1c0e4b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/git/commits/a54b6d6d60ff8e89539825d368b581e235259e74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commit/a54b6d6d60ff8e89539825d368b581e235259e74","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zk4toAKGE1NGI2ZDZkNjBmZjhlODk1Mzk4MjVkMzY4YjU4MWUyMzUyNTllNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commit/f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e","sha":"f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commits/f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e"}],"sha":"a54b6d6d60ff8e89539825d368b581e235259e74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commits/a54b6d6d60ff8e89539825d368b581e235259e74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commits/f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:32:41Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:32:41Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Become the Module Federation remote, drop the npm package\n\njp-shared was an ng-packagr library published to GitHub Packages and consumed\nthrough npm link. Every change cost a build-link-restart cycle, and SCSS path\nresolution broke after the repo split. It is now a Native Federation remote\nserving :4999.\n\nJavaScript is shared at runtime through the import map; SCSS stays shared at\nbuild time via each app''s includePaths. Two mechanisms, on purpose.\n\nFour exposed barrels under src/entries — ui, core, models, pages — are the\nentire public surface, replacing public-api.ts.\n\nThe expose keys are `ui`, not the conventional `./ui`. The runtime builds each\nimport map key as join(name, exposeKey) without normalising, so `./ui` yields\nthe specifier `jp-shared/./ui`, which no host can import.\n\nRemoved: publishConfig, .npmrc.example, the publish workflow, bump-version,\nng-package.json, tsconfig.lib*, public-api.ts, and src/lib/version.ts with its\ndrift machinery — four independent copies were the reason it existed, and there\nis one copy now.\n\n$space-24, --jp-footer-bg and section-spacing moved here from jp-public so\ntokens have one home.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5bdbe32cf59374c0c214dc713aff9113ce06927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/git/trees/f5bdbe32cf59374c0c214dc713aff9113ce06927"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/git/commits/f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commit/f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zk4toAKGY0ZjgxYWNkNzJjODNmODU0YWE5ZGEwOTI1ZjIyYjgzY2QyMDU0MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commit/de68432f99515a0f844ad570c4285bb449835095","sha":"de68432f99515a0f844ad570c4285bb449835095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-shared/commits/de68432f99515a0f844ad570c4285bb449835095"}],"sha":"f4f81acd72c83f854aa9da0925f22b83cd20540e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/