":"gustavob.paula@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Bento de Paula"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:19:50Z","email":"gustavob.paula@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Bento de Paula"},"message":"fix(golden-path): resolve platform-observability no domínio gerado\n\nO template não declarava o alias de @portal/platform-observability, mas\nplatform-runtime o importa. Um domínio recém-criado falhava no serve com\n\"Failed to run dependency scan ... could not be resolved\", porque a\nresolução parava na dependência transitiva.\n\nOs domínios existentes já traziam o alias; ele nunca voltou para o\ntemplate. Alinha vite.config.ts e vitest.config.ts com apps/beneficios.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21eb03054fc140c6092916b26c537906645871b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/git/trees/21eb03054fc140c6092916b26c537906645871b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/git/commits/e36f11f0fec6a58c8b9fd1f4cf1c00f77c24a7c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5813101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula","id":5813101,"login":"gustavobpaula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MTMxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g