7904","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zllNoAKDYwY2MzYTM3NWY5ZTFmOTc1YmEwMDdkNTY3ZDJmZGUzMzNmMjc5MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commit/be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910","sha":"be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commits/be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910"}],"sha":"60cc3a375f9e1f975ba007d567d2fde333f27904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commits/60cc3a375f9e1f975ba007d567d2fde333f27904"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5813101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula","id":5813101,"login":"gustavobpaula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MTMxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commits/be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:58:55Z","email":"gustavob.paula@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Bento de Paula"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:58:55Z","email":"gustavob.paula@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Bento de Paula"},"message":"docs: orienta quem abre o repositório pela primeira vez\n\nO README abria em pré-requisitos e uma lista de comandos, sem dizer o que\no projeto é nem por onde começar a leitura. Adiciona uma abertura com\ncaminho de leitura de dez minutos e explicita quais dependências são\nsimuladas e por quê, para que a decisão de escopo não seja lida como\nlacuna.\n\nPreenche a seção Design System, que estava vazia, e corrige o título, que\nainda nomeava apenas a primeira fase da entrega.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc774f10eb608bda0b850166429a0165b6f23608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/git/trees/cc774f10eb608bda0b850166429a0165b6f23608"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/git/commits/be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5813101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula","id":5813101,"login":"gustavobpaula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MTMxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commit/be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zllNoAKGJlMDZmNGRlNTEzOGE0YzFkZjVjZWNjNWRlZGM4MTZlNTlkMzI5MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commit/a28062bb8cc9dfda75f99d5925325d0c576ac7c9","sha":"a28062bb8cc9dfda75f99d5925325d0c576ac7c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commits/a28062bb8cc9dfda75f99d5925325d0c576ac7c9"}],"sha":"be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commits/be06f4de5138a4c1df5cecc5dedc816e59d32910"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5813101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula","id":5813101,"login":"gustavobpaula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MTMxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/commits/a28062bb8cc9dfda75f99d5925325d0c576ac7c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:52:45Z","email":"gustavob.paula@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Bento de Paula"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:52:45Z","email":"gustavob.paula@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Bento de Paula"},"message":"feat(golden-path): descreve a estrutura do domínio no dry-run\n\nO dry-run apenas validava os argumentos e imprimia uma linha, sem mostrar\no que seria criado — o que não ajuda a decidir se vale executar.\n\nAgora ele imprime a árvore completa que o domínio ocuparia: os arquivos da\naplicação, o manifesto da jornada e o registro no catálogo de governança,\nque é o que faz as fronteiras do workspace passarem a valer para o novo\ndomínio. A lista é derivada de templates/domain, a mesma fonte que o\ngenerator copia, para não divergir com o tempo.\n\nUm conflito de nome passa a ser reportado antes da descrição, em vez de\nanunciar um plano que não seria executado.\n\nO arquivo foi reformatado pelo Prettier padrão do editor; o comportamento\nde createDomain permanece inalterado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5022c2f9d740b3e3fd7369dd5f508015921394b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/git/trees/c5022c2f9d740b3e3fd7369dd5f508015921394b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gustavobpaula/portal-people/git/commits/a28062bb8cc9dfda75f99d5925325d0c576ac7c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5813101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavobpaula","id":5813101,"login":"gustavobpaula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MTMxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavobpaula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https