rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/d8941107438e8adef1e2b838c2c6a4044d4f92b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:06:14Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:06:14Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"PROJECT_MEMORY: Phase 2F — decision 2.50, gaps G17-G18, Milestone 1 next\n\n2.50 records the three pull-forwards and the one reason for all of them\n(provisioning happens in this phase), the Aadhaar decision and its reasoning,\nwhy a draft is a request rather than a JSON table, and the verification output.\n\nG12 now says THREE things Phase 3 owes, not two: create t_app_teachers,\nbackfill profiles, and assign TEACHER_FREE — because after 2F every account is\non a plan and teachers are the only exception left.\n\nNew gaps:\n  G17 — replacing one returned document opens the whole five-step form\n  G18 — a draft cannot be discarded, in the UI or the API\n\nNext Action is the Milestone 1 demo, with the four things to do before it —\nstarting with cleaning the deliberately-orphaned demo row.\n\nScreenshots at 1440 and 375 under screenshots/2f: each registration step, the\nreview, and the account-status page pending, resubmit-required and rejected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb66355f2377486b160295a6b40cfe2b41473701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/cb66355f2377486b160295a6b40cfe2b41473701"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/d8941107438e8adef1e2b838c2c6a4044d4f92b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/d8941107438e8adef1e2b838c2c6a4044d4f92b5","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGQ4OTQxMTA3NDM4ZThhZGVmMWUyYjgzOGMyYzZhNDA0NGQ0ZjkyYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9","sha":"366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9"}],"sha":"d8941107438e8adef1e2b838c2c6a4044d4f92b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/d8941107438e8adef1e2b838c2c6a4044d4f92b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T06:26:48Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T06:26:48Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"PROJECT_MEMORY: Phase 2E — decision 2.49, gaps G14-G16, Next Action 2F\n\n2.49 records the panel, the four bugs building it exposed, and why the\norchestration-failed banner is a banner rather than a toast. Screenshots at\n1440 and 375 under screenshots/2e, including the partial-completion state\nproduced by genuinely breaking provisioning.\n\nNew gaps:\n  G14 — multi-level approval is only half verified. Level advancement reads\n        configuration, proven with a two-level fixture; reject at level 2,\n        resubmit at level 2, per-level permission scoping and three-plus levels\n        have never been exercised. None of it matters until Phase 6 adds the\n        two-level offer approval. All of it matters that day, so whoever picks\n        it up should write those cases first.\n  G15 — the assigned-to filter is \"assigned to me\" only; a person picker needs\n        an admin user list endpoint that does not exist, and \"unassigned\"\n        cannot be expressed by the procedure''s NULL-means-all parameter at all.\n  G16 — branch-add requests have no tab, so one submitted today is invisible to\n        the admin.\n\nG11 is closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"987503fe98d12d710271cdbb1cea7ab80986dfef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/987503fe98d12d710271cdbb1cea7ab80986dfef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKDM2Njg3NWJmNGUxN2EzNjVmMDNhNzIxNzYwZWVjNDllMjZlY2QyYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760","sha":"f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760"}],"sha":"366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/366875bf4e17a365f03a721760eec49e26ecd2b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:30:40Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:30:40Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"PROJECT_MEMORY: Phase 2D — decision 2.48, gaps G11-G13, Next Action 2E\n\n2.48 records the cross-database orchestration and why its HTTP 200 does not\nmean the orchestration succeeded, the four verification proofs with real\noutput, the three bugs that verification caught, the deliberate teacher branch,\nthe upload hardening, and the 404-not-403 download rule.\n\nNew gaps:\n  G11 — the orchestration is retry-safe but has no API surface to trigger it\n  G12 — Phase 3 must create t_app_teachers AND backfill every teacher who\n        registered before it existed; doing only the first surfaces as a null\n        reference in Phase 5 rather than an obvious missing row\n  G13 — no virus scanning; the hook is after validation and before storage\n\nSuite count in the 2A+2B+2C summary corrected to 30/30 now that G10 is closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ddce3a324fdad687fc35d47d3d33ad97c0eba98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/8ddce3a324fdad687fc35d47d3d33ad97c0eba98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGY4ZTM1MjEwM2Y2ZDE4MjU3ZjlkMTI5YmQ5MDYwY2I2ZDkwZTE3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9","sha":"cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9"}],"sha":"f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/f8e352103f6d18257f9d129bd9060cb6d90e1760"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:26:56Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:26:56Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Correct 2.46''s concurrency coverage claim, and add G10\n\nIndependent verification of 2C found the RowVersion check works but was never\nactually reached by the test that claimed to prove it.\n\nWith one configured level, any successful approve completes the request, so a\nsecond attempt is refused by the status check — INVALID_STATUS, \"already\napproved\" — before RowVersion is ever compared. The suite''s concurrency\nassertion passed, but not for the reason recorded.\n\nIsolated it inside a rolled-back transaction by making request type 1\ntwo-level: approve at level 1 leaves the request Pending at level 2 with\nIsCompleted 0, and a stale RowVersion then returns CONCURRENCY_CONFLICT with no\ntrail row. So the engine is right and 2.46''s claim about the check is right —\nwhat was wrong was the claim about coverage. Corrected in place rather than\nquietly, because the next person reading it would otherwise trust a test that\ndoes not test what it says.\n\nThat run also confirmed multi-level advancement genuinely works rather than\nbeing dead code on a single-level seed.\n\nG10 records what is still missing: a suite case that reaches the RowVersion\nbranch, with the two-level fixture spelled out. It is a coverage gap, not a bug.\n\nProgress log carries the verification itself — nine scenarios including three\ngenuinely parallel sessions, which landed on an identical SubmittedOn tick and\nproduced distinct contiguous request numbers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9709d133202eadf0fce2309c3c138ffc9062def7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/9709d133202eadf0fce2309c3c138ffc9062def7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGNkM2RiMzM5ODgyNjQzZjVjNmQ4NjlkMmIyN2VjMmY1MjRmYmJlZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56","sha":"8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56"}],"sha":"cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/cd3db339882643f5c6d869d2b27ec2f524fbbee9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:01:51Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:01:51Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record the master data seed (2.47) and point Next Action at 2D\n\nWhat was seeded fully, what is provisional and why, row counts per table, and\nthe Code-is-stable / Name-is-editable rule that makes a client rename a one\ncolumn update rather than a migration.\n\nThe district/city decision with its consequence spelled out: both empty, all\nthe CityId columns confirmed nullable, and the forms hide the dropdown rather\nthan showing an empty one — an empty dropdown reads as broken, not as absent.\n\nThe dataset source is recorded so Phase 3 does not work it out again: LGD at\nlgdirectory.gov.in, official codes, CSV export — and explicitly not a random\nindian-cities.json off GitHub. Plus the shape the import script should take.\n\nOpen question 5 goes from blocking to unblocked-but-pending, with a table of\nexactly what needs reconciling and how confident each row is, so the client''s\nlist is a lookup rather than a 300-row diff by eye.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f3bb47a982a85bd159f1b53b3bcb91c0df897d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/6f3bb47a982a85bd159f1b53b3bcb91c0df897d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKDhkN2YyZTY5NWExODM1MmIyMGQ5YzE3NjhiYzVhZjJlNGJlYzRhNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/47e9232022927ef082b8fa81f0578e10f9b18e5f","sha":"47e9232022927ef082b8fa81f0578e10f9b18e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/47e9232022927ef082b8fa81f0578e10f9b18e5f"}],"sha":"8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8d7f2e695a18352b20d9c1768bc5af2e4bec4a56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/47e9232022927ef082b8fa81f0578e10f9b18e5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:39:07Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:39:07Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Point Next Action at 2B now that 2A and 2C are done\n\nSection 7 still said ''NEXT: PHASE 2A'' after both phases had shipped — the same\nstaleness that had it sending Phase 2 into frontend/apps/admin before. It is the\none page someone picking this up reads first, so it is the one that hurts most\nwhen it is wrong.\n\nNow: 2A and 2C marked complete with the verified numbers, and Next Action is 2B,\nstated plainly as blocked on the client''s master data lists rather than as\nwork waiting to be done. Lists what is needed from the client, per master.\n\nAlso names what can proceed while 2B waits — 2D endpoints, 2E admin screens,\n2F school screens — since none of them need seed data, and 2E closes the gap\nwhere approving a school still means running a Swagger call by hand.\n\nCarries forward the two mistakes this phase paid for: a procedure''s result set\nand its test''s temp table move together, 