m/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/852beac0afe99347e6842ded24e1f0c536e7f83a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:07:08Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:07:08Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record Phase 2A build notes (2.45)\n\nThe RoleId type finding, the full timezone classification, the business keys\nadded beyond the specified minimum and why, the one-pending-per-entity index,\nand why seed stops at five masters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec677f08be2c32e56822bac3d1945466c9fd5f75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/ec677f08be2c32e56822bac3d1945466c9fd5f75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/852beac0afe99347e6842ded24e1f0c536e7f83a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/852beac0afe99347e6842ded24e1f0c536e7f83a","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKDg1MmJlYWMwYWZlOTkzNDdlNjg0MmRlZDI0ZTFmMGM1MzZlN2Y4M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37","sha":"ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37"}],"sha":"852beac0afe99347e6842ded24e1f0c536e7f83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/852beac0afe99347e6842ded24e1f0c536e7f83a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:51:36Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:51:36Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record E2E testing as Phase 8, and rescue the Playwright scripts\n\nYou asked me to note which repo the Playwright setup lives in. It did not live\nin one: no dependency in any package.json, no config, no spec files anywhere in\nthe seven repositories. Every run this phase came from an npx cache with the\nscripts in a session scratch directory, so Phase 8 would have started from\nnothing — which is the opposite of what the note was for.\n\nSo the eight reusable ones are now committed at jp-docs/scripts/verify/ with a\nREADME explaining what each checks, npm scripts to run them, and playwright and\nlighthouse declared as devDependencies. They are declared but not installed;\nnobody has needed them in a checkout yet.\n\nThey live in jp-docs because most of them cross app boundaries — the chooser\nflow spans jp-public into jp-school and jp-teacher, the federation check spans a\nhost and the remote, and the cross-app guard is two apps. jp-docs is the only\nrepository that sits beside all the others, and all three Phase 8 flows are\nmulti-app for the same reason.\n\nG9 records why the suite was not written earlier: the screens are still moving,\nand a test against a screen that changes next week costs more to maintain than\nit saves — and does not get deleted, it gets skipped, which is worse.\n\nIt also carries the two traps already paid for. A click landing before hydration\ndoes nothing and reads as a validation failure, which is exactly how the contact\nform once reported 0 field errors while working correctly; the fix is retrying\nuntil the app responds, not a longer fixed wait. And a sticky header appearing\npartway down a fullPage screenshot is a stitching artifact, which was once\nreported as a rendering bug on the contact page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f4c5aa667f73a5e9576a1a6fbc5527cc8ccdaf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/2f4c5aa667f73a5e9576a1a6fbc5527cc8ccdaf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGFkN2U0YWE4OGEwODJmYzdmMzg4NGI1N2E0MTFhYjhjNTAzZTBhMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6","sha":"5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6"}],"sha":"ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/ad7e4aa88a082fc7f3884b57a411ab8c503e0a37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:42:50Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:42:50Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Close out Phase 1: verification results and a consolidated gaps list\n\nPhase 1 marked complete with the actual numbers: both APIs clean-rebuild at\n0 warnings 0 errors, 121/121 SQL assertions, all five frontend production\nbuilds clean, and jp_sso at 20 tables, 32 procedures, 4 functions, 71 indexes.\n\nNew section 2A collects everything deliberately incomplete, stubbed or\ndeferred, so Phase 5 does not rediscover it. Ordered by what would hurt most.\n\nG0 is that none of the seven repositories has a git remote. Every commit is\nlocal. Phase 1 exists on one disk, and that is a bigger risk than anything else\non the list.\n\nTwo of the reported items were not open:\n\n- The password Show toggle is already fixed. Verified in the browser rather\n  than by reading the code, because the code implied the opposite of the\n  report: it appears on typing, clears when empty, returns when retyped, and\n  flips to Hide with type=text.\n- The four public-site layout items were fixed earlier the same day in\n  c7fe8fd, and the contact header was a Playwright fullPage artifact rather\n  than a bug. Recorded as resolved with the evidence so they are not listed\n  again next time.\n\nThe other three design items are carried as reported; I did not re-verify them\nand the entry says so.\n\nNext Action is Phase 2A, the jp_mdm database, with the decisions to read first\nand the per-table discipline that jp_sso used — including that a procedure''s\ntest moves in the same commit as its result set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4a57e3391dee806897735917ae50ca4379598bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/b4a57e3391dee806897735917ae50ca4379598bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKDUyNzBkZTU1OWY1MzMwYzU1MWY1NzlkZDVkMjc1Zjk3OTBjNjMzZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976","sha":"f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976"}],"sha":"5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/5270de559f5330c551f579dd5d275f9790c633d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:47:00Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:47:00Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record the public site build (2.44)\n\nWhat was built, and what was deliberately left out: job search and featured\njobs to Phase 4, the contact endpoint to Phase 7, and legal copy to client\nsign-off. Records the two accessibility defects Lighthouse found — the subtle\ntoken failing contrast at label sizes, and body links distinguished by colour\nalone — and that the token value itself was not changed because the apps share\nit.\n\nHOW_TO_RUN 3.7 said jp-public was unfederated and little else; it now lists the\neight routes, the prerender split, the SEO surface, and the three things that\nare not finished.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c6c07efa41046a219ca9e0f65f010348944d073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/4c6c07efa41046a219ca9e0f65f010348944d073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGY0YTUzNTU3N2FhNmYyYjIwYmZhNDZlODg4MzMzZTU0NmYyZjA5NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094","sha":"d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094"}],"sha":"f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/f4a535577aa6f2b20bfa46e888333e546f2f0976"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:05:57Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:05:57Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Fix a cross-reference broken by the 3.x renumbering\n\nSection 7 pointed at HOW_TO_RUN §3.4 and §3.5 for the two Phase 2 gotchas.\nInserting the ''what to start for what'' table shifted everything down one, so\nthose are now §3.5 and §3.6. Verified the rest: every decision number cited in\nPROJECT_MEMORY exists, both internal HOW_TO_RUN references resolve, and the\ndocumented ports match all five angular.json files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8611390815d5c38db8d05bdf67ced5ca2cc48312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/8611390815d5c38db8d05bdf67ced5ca2cc48312"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGQwZDI2YzliMjM4NDNjZDIzZmI0MDIzMTI5ZTU5MTg5ZTU2NjMwOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d","sha":"8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d"}],"sha":"d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/d0d26c9b23843cd23fb4023129e59189e5663094"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:03:44Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:03:44Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record why the chooser lives in jp-public, and what testing it needs\n\nThree things 2.43 was missing:\n\n- Why jp-public owns the entry point at all. The three apps sit on separate\n  origins, so no app can offer the choice from inside itself — it has already\n  picked an audience. jp-public is the only place all three are visible from.\n- That the page is not unfinished. Two cards, permanently. Someone will\n  eventually try to \"complete\" it with an admin card, and the reason not to is\n  now written down next to the rule.\n- That the chooser did not change jp-public''s unfederated status. It still\n  imports zero shared JavaScript; both cards are built from its own styles.\n\nHOW_TO_RUN 3.2 claimed the public site needs \"nothing else\". True of the page,\nfalse of the flow: following a card crosses into jp-school or jp-teacher, and\nthat app needs the remote. Added as its own row, since it is now a legitimate\nreason to run jp-public during Phase 1 work.\n\nVerified by clicking all four paths for real, not by reading hrefs:\n\n  mode=login   school  -> :4300/auth/login      ui-auth-shell rendered\n  mode=login   teacher -> :4400/auth/login      ui-auth-shell rendered\n  mode=signup  school  -> :4300/auth/register   ui-auth-shell rendered\n  mode=signup  teacher -> :4400/auth/register   ui-auth-shell rendered\n\nNo 404s, no console errors, mode carried in both directions. Screenshots at\n1440 and 375 retaken against the current build; jp-public''s SSR production\nbuild still emits server bundles with /continue server-rendered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31fb738f22dc0c15e12c70eecc70bbfc7d467754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/31fb738f22dc0c15e12c70eecc70bbfc7d467754"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKDgwMThlZTZiZTFiYWUwYzQ3OGMxNjc5YTk1ZDcyOTg3ZDczODYzOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797","sha":"8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797"}],"sha":"8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8018ee6be1bae0c478c1679a95d72987d738638d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:54:42Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:54:42Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Remove the npm decision outright; rewrite HOW_TO_RUN for a stranger\n\nThe npm/GitHub Packages decision is deleted rather than marked superseded. A\nhalf-removed decision is how someone reverts this in three months, so 2.40 (the\none-workspace model, which never shipped) is gone entirely and 2.41 keeps only\nwhat is still true: seven sibling repos, backend as one repo, jp-docs, the\ncross-app guard, token storage, master data in jp-admin, and the parallel-session\ndiscipline. Its GitHub Packages, link-vs-publish, preserveSymlinks and\nversion-drift subsections are removed.\n\nWhat remains of npm in the file is deliberate and lives in 2.42: why it was\nabandoned, and an inventory of exactly what was deleted so nobody re-adds it.\n\nAdds 2.43 for the /continue audience chooser — the fork, the compiler-enforced\nabsence of an admin option, which entry points skip it, why it is server-\nrendered, and the design-token drift it uncovered on the public site.\n\nRewrites section 7. It was the most dangerous page in the file: it still told\nPhase 2 to write into frontend/apps/admin and import from @jp/ui, neither of\nwhich exists. It now names the real repos, the four barrels, the start order,\nand the two gotchas.\n\nHOW_TO_RUN:\n- Section 2 rewritten from a clone onwards, including the appsettings.Development\n  copy step that was missing entirely, with correct jp-backend paths.\n- New 3.2: what to start for what you are doing. Working on school screens needs\n  jp-shared, the SSO API and jp-school — and nothing else.\n- Two troubleshooting entries for the failures actually hit: an app rendering\n  nothing because the remote is down, and \"Can''t find stylesheet to import\"\n  when jp-shared is not a sibling, which is the one that bites CI.\n- Section 5''s click-through assumed the single portal and sent school signup to\n  :4200. It now crosses :4300 and :4200 correctly and covers per-audience reset\n  links and the public chooser.\n- Section 7 had \"cd jp-backenddatabase\", a broken path from an earlier edit, and\n  built only one of the five projects.\n\nVerified the documented test command runs: 31/31 menu assertions pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a96b499ffbda45350d13249732903d835987d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/8a96b499ffbda45350d13249732903d835987d63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKDhhYzdjODdlNzljMDQ5NDdlN2RhNGJiNGU4OWQ5OWFkY2JlZTQ3OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b","sha":"a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b"}],"sha":"8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/8ac7c87e79c04947e7da4bb4e89d99adcbee4797"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:39:45Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:39:45Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record decision 2.42: Module Federation, frontend structure LOCKED\n\nReplaces the npm-package half of 2.41. That section stays in place, marked\nsuperseded rather than deleted, so nobody proposes reverting to it without\nfirst reading what happened.\n\n2.42 records why npm was abandoned, the runtime-JavaScript / build-time-SCSS\nsplit, the singleton requirement and the evidence for it, the jp-public\noutcome, the production single point of failure and its mitigation, and the CI\nsibling-checkout requirement.\n\nThree things in there cost real time to find and are not in any documentation:\n\n- The expose keys must be `ui`, not `./ui`. The runtime builds each import map\n  key as join(name, exposeKey) without normalising, so the conventional form\n  yields a specifier no host can import.\n- Hosts must turn off ignoreUnusedDeps, because Sheriff refuses files outside\n  the project root and the tsconfig paths deliberately point at a sibling repo.\n  The knock-on cost is an @angular/animations dependency nothing imports.\n- Running a production build while a dev server is running poisons the shared\n  federation externals cache, and the app then fails with \"ngDevMode is not\n  defined\", which points nowhere near the cause.\n\nHOW_TO_RUN section 3 is rewritten around the new start order — jp-shared on\n:4999 first — and carries the same two failure modes as troubleshooting.\n\nbootstrap.mjs no longer clones-installs-links; there is nothing to link.\ncheck-versions.mjs is deleted outright: it existed because four apps installed\nthe library independently and could drift, and there is one running copy now.\n\nAlso adds the screenshots for the /continue chooser at 1440 and 375, and the\nfederation verification shots for all three hosts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f319c398aa41a227c94ae0d743cc3d719c1c5144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/f319c398aa41a227c94ae0d743cc3d719c1c5144"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515","id":105528886,"login":"Tarun1515","node_id":"U_kgDOBko-Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b","node_id":"C_kwDOT4zoeNoAKGE3ZTdiZTFmNmZmZDA5ZTQzMDUxY2NlZmNkNjExNzQ1N2ZiOTgxMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commit/c99fe2c25c49887fb330c53c145e59fd36ca68ba","sha":"c99fe2c25c49887fb330c53c145e59fd36ca68ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/c99fe2c25c49887fb330c53c145e59fd36ca68ba"}],"sha":"a7e7be1f6ffd09e43051ccefcd6117457fb9810b","url":"