5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/commits/345da1512ed74b7e13cc1baeb9a8bf25239d976d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T16:54:37Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T16:54:37Z","email":"bhardwajtarun22@gmail.com","name":"Tarun Bhardwaj"},"message":"Record the seven-repo migration\n\nDecision 2.41: seven sibling repositories, jp-backend stays one repo, jp-docs\nis cloned beside the others and never copied into them.\n\nHOW_TO_RUN gains the link-vs-publish modes, the check-versions output, and the\nNG0203 duplicate-Angular symptom with its fix — that one cost an afternoon\nduring the migration itself.\n\n2.40 is kept and marked superseded: the decisions inside it (cross-app guard,\nstorage prefix, menu prefix stripping) carried over unchanged and their\nreasoning lives there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7da8a427673cc285b9e83b2d2aa9864e4a83787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/trees/f7da8a427673cc285b9e83b2d2aa9864e4a83787"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tarun1515/jp-docs/git/commits/345da1512ed74b7e13cc1baeb9a8bf25239d976d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105528886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tarun1515/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.